<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- NTP NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Mishingo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mishingo YabaPositoli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mishingo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mish</para>
  <para style="mt1">MISHINGO</para>
  <para style="mt2">yabaPositoli</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwhalo yeMishingo yabaPositoli lungano lwokutangisa kwegubungano nokumwalalika kwalo kuvila kuJelusalema kunda kuJudiya, Samalia, zwindila mbeli, swokuleba kwaJesu kubalayijwa Babe esanhu enda kudenga (Mishingo 1.8). Yakakwalwa naLuka uliiye akale wakakwala iNdebo iMbuya yaLuka. Wakabeli undapi akale wakalondejela zwimomunsi. Iye wakabekwalila Tiyofelasi, uNgiliki, iwhalo jose imbili, iNdebo iMbuya yaLuka neMishingo, koga iwhalo yeji jinoboneka kuti jakabekwalilwa maKristo wose, bechiGiliki nabechiJuda (1.1)</para>
  <para style="ip">Mishingo lwakakwalwa pakati pamakole makumi mashanu negumi kuswika kumakole mashanu anegumi limwempela namakole mana Jesu azwalwa, nokuti iwhalo yeyi inopela unshaji Paulu asanu abhiswa muntolongo. Luka naiye wakabenda noMpositoli Paulu, akale zwingata kuti Luka iwhalo yeyi wakaikwalila muguta lyeAntioko. Unshingo wokukwala iNdebo iMbuya wakaba uchinondilambeli nokuti Mishingo yakatangiswa Jesu paakenda kudenga. Chinangwa chaLuka pakukwala iwhalo yeyi chingaba sechokukwala iNdebo iMbuya yiye. Wakabeda kuti Tiyofelasi nabanji maKristo bakabeshanduka bebe nechokomende nozwabakabelayijwa nobupenyu bwaJesu akale nokumwalalika kobuKristo, nokukwala zwimomunsi nobupenyu bwaJesu akale nokumwalajika kobuKristo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwhalo yeMishingo inotipa chitondejelo chokutangisa kwegubungano akale nokuti kwakabelichini kugala mukudimbwa munaJesu. Zwitondejelo zwabaPositoli zwinotitondeja kuti tingabimba mumasimba oMpepo uNchena mukumwalaja indayijo yeNdebo iMbuya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Kutangisila pakezha uMpepo uNchena kubalayijwa baJesu igubungano lyakatangisa kukubuka (1.1, 8.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zwinotobela igubungano lyakayabiswa likatanga akale kumwalajika kunda kuzhe mbeli kweJelusalema (8.2, 12.23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mushule mozwi Paulu wakenda kulwendo lwotanga lobumishonali (12.24, 14.28)</para>
  <para style="io1">Igota lyakashangana kuJelusalema kusunga mulawo wabadimbwi bapya (15.1-35)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwakatobela lwendo lwebili lwaPaulu lwobumishonali (15.36, 18.22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mushule mozwi wakenda lwendo lulwe lwetatu (18.23, 20.38)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova Paulu esungwa muJelusalema (21.26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kopejeleja wakasengwa kuRoma (21-28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Tiyofilasi unodikanwa, Muwhalo yotanga ndakakwala pezhulu pezwito zwaJesu zwaakatanga kuta akale nokulayija, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />kuswika izhuba lyaakatolwa enda kudenga, wakalaya bapositoli baakashala nesimba lyoMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kunaibo wakazwitondejela elimpenyu mushule mokuyabiswa nozwisimiso zwechokomende kwamazhuba makumi mana ebhaunula zwoBushe bwaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Akabungana nabo, wakabalaya kuti besibhude muJelusalema koga bemilile bejine bewane chibimbiso chaMwali Tate, beti, “Mwakawha zwandakamubuja, kuti, <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Joni wakabhabhatiza nevula, koga imwi moobhabhatizwa noMpepo uNchena, mumazhuba mashoma anotobela moobhabhatizwa noMpepo uNchena.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unotolwa ensengwa kudenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Sezwo pabakati babapamwepela beliboga, balayijwa babe bakombhuza, beti “Tezi, nonshaji yono unobwiliza na ngweno bushe kubaIzilayeli!”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Wakati kwabali, “Azwitoba zwenu kuziba unshaji kana igole, Mwali Tate zwabakabiga musimba lyabo. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Koga imwi mootambula isimba, uMpepo uNchena pauchezha pezhulu penu, mooba basumikiji bangu kuJelusalema nokuJudiya nokuSamaliya nokunopelela inyika yose.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Paakapeja kulebeleka yezwi, balayijwa babe bechakalinga, wakanyamulwa, igole likonsikatila mumesho abo.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Bechakalinga kudenga bebona kunda kukwe, bakabona pekama pelyo nabo, banhulume babili bakambala ingubo inchena jinobaima, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />bakati kwabali, “Banhulume bokuGalili, mulomilani mwakatokoloja kudenga na? Yoyu Jesu, watolwa akasengwa kudenga, unoobuya nenzila yamombona etolwa nayo enda kudenga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakatola chigalo chaJudasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Bakabwilila kuJelusalema beva kudunhu linowhi Olivi, lipo pelyo neJelusalema, lwendo lunovumilwa mumulawo nezhuba lyeSabata, <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />pabakangwina, bakenda mungumba yakabeli pezhulu mwabakaba begala, Pita naJoni naJemusi na Endulu, naFilipu naTomasi, na naMateo, naBhatilomeyo naJemusi mwananhulumyana waAlufiyasi naSimoni unsungwaji naJudasi mwananhulumyana waJemusi. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bose yaba bakabhatana nomwoyo umwempela bakazwipila mukunamata, belipamwempela namamai naMariya amai baJesu nabanuna babe.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mumazhuba yayo Pita wakanyamuka pakati pabanakwaina (igubungano linabanhu bangaswika kuzana namakumi mabili) akati, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Banakwaina,” wakati, “Iwhalo inchena jakaba jikwelela kuzhajikijwa, zwakalebwa noMpepo uNchena nondomo waDavidi, nozwaJudasi wakatungamila yabo bakasunga Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Wakabakalabwa nasu akale eli umwe wabashingi sasu muna yobu bunshingili.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Yoyu unhulume wakatenga minda nendipo yonshingo umbi, mwakawila nonsholo akakwamuka untumbu akabhuda bula. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Yezwi zwakazibikana kubagali bose beJelusalema, nokudalo yoyu uminda wakawhi Akelidama, mululimi lwabo, zwileba kuti, “uMinda weLopa.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Akale zwakakwalwa mulukwalo lweJimbo kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Bugalo bubwe ngebube idongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">akale pesibe nonhu uchagala mwakale.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Zwilokwalwa akale kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Umwe ngetole unshingo uwe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Sokudalo, umwe wabanhulume babelinasu unshaji ose tili naShe Jesu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />zwitangisila pambhabhatizo waJoni, kuswikila unshaji wakatolwa kuva kunasu, umwe waaba banhulume unokwelela kuba nasu unsumikiji wokumuka kukwe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Kwakadombolwa mazina mabili, Josefa waluwhi Bhasabhasi akale ewhi Jusitusi, naMatiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Bakanamata beti, “Imwi She, munoziba zwose zwimomumyoyo yabanhu bose, titondejeni umwashala pababili yaba, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kuti ebe umwe uchashinga nasu munoyu unshingo wobupositoli wakasiyiwa naJudasi paakaleya enda nenzila yiye.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bakata ifumbefumbe, ikambwelela kuna Matiyasi, akalabwa nabapositoli baligumi nomwempela.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuzha koMpepo uNchena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Palyakaswika izhuba lyePentekositi, bakagala pabugalo bumwempela. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Pakalepo kwakawhikana untimbo uva kudenga, sebhepo, ukazhala ingumba yose mubakabeligele. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Bakabona isasi jomoto jikagala pana umwe noumwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bose bakazhajwa noMpepo uNchena, bakatanga kulebeleka nejimwe indimi, sokupiwa kwabo noMpepo kuti belebeleke.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />KuJelusalema kwakabegala maJuda, bakalulama, bakabeva kunyika jose, jopasi pedenga. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pakuwhikana kwontimbo yoyu, luvute lwabanhu lwakezha pamwempela, kukaba negangakanga, nokuti umwe noumwe wakabawha belebeleka lulimi lulwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bose bakachenama nokushama, bakati kunoumwe noumwe, “Bose yaba bakumulebeleka abatova kuGalili na? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Feno, ini kuti umwe noumwe wedu tibawha mululimi lulwe? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />BaPatiya nabaMidi nabaElamaiti, nabagali bokuMesopotamiya, nokuJudiya, nabokuKapadosia, kuPontusi akale neEzhiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Filijiya nePamfiliya, Ijipiti nobumwe bugalo bweLibhiya bweSayilini, nabashanyi banova kuRoma, nabamwe bokuzhe bakashandukila kuchiJuda, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />baKiletani namaAlabhu timubawha belebeleka indimi jedu, bebanda mishingo mikulwana yaMwali.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Akale bose bakashama akale bakakankamala, beti kunoumwe noumwe, “Yezwi zwinolebani biya!”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Bamwe bakaseka beti, “Yaba balokolwa newaini impya.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilayilo chaPita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Koga Pita, elimile nabaligumi linaumwe, wakanyamula iwhi lilye akati kwabali, “Matate bokuJudiya nabagali bose bomuJelusalema, izibani yezwi, akale muwhisise mawhi angu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Yaba banhulume abajilokolwa, sezwamumuyeya, ngweno zwichizhingwanangwana, iawa yatatu yezhuba, <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Koga yezwi ndizwo zwakalebwa nondebambeli waMwali, Jowelo,” eti,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Mwali unoti yezwi zwichatikana mumazhuba opejeleja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ndichadila uMpepo wangu penyama yose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bana benu banhulumyana nabana benu banhukajana banoopolofita zwaMwali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">akale bazhuzha benu banoobona mibono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">nenhutana jenu jinoolota maloto.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Kasa munayomazhuba ndinoodila uMpepo wangu pezhulu pabalanda nabalandakaji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ibo banoopolofita.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ndinootondejela zwichenamiso pezhulu kudenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">nezwitondejelo pasi munyika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ilopa nomoto nobusi,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />izhuba linooshandulwa libe inhilima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">nomweji ubelopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">kusanhu kwaswika izhuba lyaShe, izhuba igulwana lilye<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Akale zwinooba kuti yoyo unoshomeja izina lyaShe unoochijwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Banhu bomuIzilayeli, iwhani mawhi yaya, Jesu wokuNazaleta, uNhulume umwakapiwa naMwali wakaba nezwishamiso, zwichenamiso nezwitondejelo, Mwali zwaakashinga naye mukati mwenu, sezwamunoziba bo. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Iye yoyu Jesu wakapilwa sokulonga kwaMwali muluzibo lulwe lwambeli, wakapilwa mumaboko abokuzhe kuzhe komulawo kuti muunkahamile panchinjikwa ebulayiwe, <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Koga Mwali wakomusa mubafi, akonsupula mubugalo bwolufu, nokuti azwijakabetubukana kuti angakomwa nolufu. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Davidi unoti pezhulu pape,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Ndakombona Tezi wangu elimbeli kwangu unshaji wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">eli kululyi lwangu kuti ndisizungunuke,<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />nokudalo moyo wangu wakashanta, nolulimi lwangu lunonakilwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">nenyama yangu inoogala mulubimbo.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Iwi autoonsiya moyo wangu mubugalo bwolufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">akale autoonsiya Unchena uwo kuti ebole.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wakandilaya inzila yobupenyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">unoondizhaja nolushanto pakubona chiso chicho.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Banakwaina, lekejani ndilebeleke pachena nezwatategulu bedu Davidi, kuti iye wakafa akale akajikwa, negumbu lilye tinanalyo kuswikila nasi. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Nokudalo, elimpolofeti, akale eziba ikowhe lyaMwali kunaiye, lyokuti kuchava munchelo wombili uwe, uchagala pechigalo chiche chobushe. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Nokudalo iye, mukubona zwambeli yezwi, wakalebeleka nezwokumuka kwaKristo kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“Aajakasiyiwa mubugalo bwabakafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">nombili uwe aujakabola.”<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yoyu Jesu wakamuswa naMwali mubafi, isu tose tibasumikiji. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Nokudalo ulonyamulwa, ugele kuluboko lolulyi lwaMwali, nokutambula kunaTate chibimbiso choMpepo uNchena, ndiye wadila yezwi zwimubweni nokuwha. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Davidi iye aajakenda kudenga, koga unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Tezi wakati kunaTezi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Gala kuluboko lwangu lwokululyi,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />kujine ndite babengi babo bebe chibhula chamakumbo awo.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Nokudalo bujani ingumba yaIzilayeli yose kuti izibe ichokomende kuti, Mwali, wakata kuti yoyu Jesu wamwakakahamila, ebe Tezi akale Mesiya.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ngweno pabakawha yezwi, zwakababhaya mumyoyo, bakati kuna Pita nabamwe bapositoli bose, “Banakwaina titeni na!”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Pita akati kwabali, “Shandukani, mubhabhatizwe umwe nomwe muzina lyaJesu Kristo kuti luchinyo lwenu lulekejelwe, akale mutambule chipo choMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Chibimbiso chatiwa kunamwi nokubana benu, nabanji bachikokule, banoshobwa naMwali She wedu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Wakalebeleka ebasungwaja namamwe mawhi manji eti, “Zwichijeni munechi chizekululu chisakalulama.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Pakalepo yabo bakatambula mawhi awe nolushanto bakabhabhatizwa, nelyo izhuba mipepo zwiulu zwitatu yakashanduka ikapamhijwa kwabali. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Akale bakendila mbeli besungwalila kulayija lwabapositoli nokukamujana, nokumedula chinkwa nokunamata.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupenyu mubavumili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Lutyo lwakangwina mubanhu bose, nokuti zwichenamiso nezwitondejelo zwinji zwakatiwa nabapositoli. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Akale bose bakadimbwa bakaba pamwempela, zwose zwabo zwaluba zwonhu wose, <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />akale bakatengesa ifuma nezwibya zwabo, bakakobelana bose umwe noumwe sokushayiwa kwabo. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Izhuba nezhuba bakabeshangana mutempeli nomwoyo umwempela, bemedula chinkwa mujingumba jabo, belya kulya kwabo mulushanto akale nomwoyonchena, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />bekuja Mwali akale bediwa nabanhu bose. She wakapamhija buwandi bwaabo bakabechijwa izhuba nezhuba.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Unkumbili igosha unochijwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ngweno Pita naJoni bakabenda mutempeli neawa yokunamata, iawa yashanu nena. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Pakabeli noumwe unhulume wakabeli igosha kuva mukuzwalwa kukwe, wakabenyamulwa izhuba nezhuba ebigwa peshubo linowhi Ibuya, kunokumbila lubhancho kunaabo bakabengwina mutempeli. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Paakabona Pita naJoni belobongwina mutempeli, wakakumbila lubhancho. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Pita wakondingisisa naJoni, akati kwaali, “Tilinge.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Iye wakabalingisisa, eyeyesela kuti unotambula chimwe chinhu kwabali. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Koga Pita wakati, “Isiliva nendalama andina, koga zwandinanazwo ndokupa, muzina lyaJesu Kristo wokuNazaleta, nyamuka ukwende.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Wakombhata noluboko lwokululyi akomilija, pakalepo makumbo awe notungongovi zwakasima. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Wakashotoka, akama, akakwenda engwina mutempeli nabo, ekwenda eshotoka akale ekuja Mwali. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Bose banhu bakombona ekwenda ekuja Mwali, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />bakonziba kuti ndiye igosha walugala peShubo Ibuya lyetempeli ekumbila lubhancho, bakaba nokutya nokuchenama nezwakatikana kwaali.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilayijo chaPita mutempeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Wakabatobela Pita naJoni esichinoda kupambukana nabo, banhu bose bakalabukila kwabakabeli mugumbi linowhi lyaSolomoni, bakachenama zwikulugulu. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Abona yezwi, Pita wakati kubanhu, “Banhu bomuIzilayeli, ini muchenamiswa nezwi, akale motitokolojelani alo, sofana yezwi zwatikana, tazwita nesimba lyedu kana nobululami bwedu kuti yoyu ekwende? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mwali waAbhulahamu, naIsaki, naJakobe, Mwali wamatategulu edu, wakuja unshingi uwe Jesu, umwakapila akale mukondamba mbeli kwaPilato, eda kunsungunula. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Koga mwakalamba uNchena akale wakalulama mukakumbila umbulayi kuti esunungulwe, <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />mukabulaya mweni wobupenyu, iye akamuswa naMwali munabakafa. Nokudalo isu tibasumikiji kunezwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Izina lilye, akale mukudimbwa muzina lilye, ndizwo zwasimisa unhulume yoyu umubweni umunoziba, nokudimbwa muzina lyaJesu ndizwo zwonchilisa mbeli kwenu mose. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Ngweno, banakwaina ndinoziba kuti mwakazwita nokusoziba pamwempela nabatongi benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Koga zwose zwakalebwa naMwali mumilomo yabapolofeti babe, kuti Kristo uwe unooyabiswa, yezwi iye wazwizhajikija. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nokudalo chingunukani, kuti mulekejelwe luchinyo lwenu, nokutonhojwa mumesho aShe, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />akale kuti etume Kristo, waakashalila imwi, Jesu, <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />iye unokwelela kutambulwa nedenga, kuswikila zwose zwatiwa zwakalebwa naMwali nemilomo yabapolofeti baMwali bachena kuvila ntolo. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mozesi wakati, ‘She Mwali wenu unoomupa uMpolofeti unova kubanakwaina benu unanga sami. Imwi mokwelela kuunwhilila munaizwo zwose zwaachamubuja. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Akale unhu wose usinonwhilila undebambeli waMwali yoyu unoopalajwa ebhiswa mubanhu.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Akale bose bapolofeti baMwali bakalebeleka, kuvila kunaSamiyele naibo bakontobela, bose bakapupula nozwamazhuba yaya. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Imwi mubana banhulumyana babapolofeti, akale bechivumilano chakatiwa naMwali namatategulu enu, eti kuna Abhulahamu, ‘Akale muchizekululu chicho imhuli jenyika yose jinookombolelwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Mwali, wakamusa uNdanda uwe, wakontuma kunamwi kutanga, kumukombolela nokushandula umwe noumwe wenu mububi bubwe.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pita naJoni mbeli kwegota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Bechinolebeleka nabanhu, batebuji, nonkulwana wabalindi betempeli akale nabaSadusi bakezha kwabali, <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />bakabakanyema, nokuti bakaba belayija nezwo kumuka kwaJesu munabakafa. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Bakabasunga bakababiga muntolongo, sezwo kwakababa madeko. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Koga, banji bakawha iwhi bakadimbwa, banhulume bakashanduka bakabeswika kuzwiulu zwingaba zwishanu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Muchimuka, batongi babo, bakulwana bobugalo, nabakwali bakabaka bungana muJelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />naAnasi untebuji unkulwana wakabelipo naKefasi naJoni naAlekizanda, nabanji bemhuli yobutebuji bukulwana. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pabakabamisa pakati pabo, bakababhuza beti, “Yezwi zwinhu mwazwita namasimba ani kana kuti muzina lyani!”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Pita, azhajwa noMpepo Nchena, wakabashandula eti, “Imwi batongi babanhu akale namwi bakulwana, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />kana isu nasi titongeselwa kuta chinhu chibuya, chakatilwa unhu igosha, kuti wakachijwa neni, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />ngezwizibikane kwamuli mose, akale nokubanhu bose baIzilayeli, kuti muzina lyaJesu Kristo wokuNazaleta, umwakakahamila panchinjikwa, wakamuswa naMwali kubafi, ndiye watubulisa kuti yoyu unhulume eme mbeli kwenu eliumpenyu. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yeli ndilyo ibwe lyakalambwa namwi babaki.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“Koga ndilyo lyaba ibwe linodikana pamabwe wose.”<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />“Apana umwe unowanisa luchijo, akale akuna limwe izina pasi pedenga, lyakapiwa banhu kuti bewane kuchijwa.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ngweno pabakabona myoyo isina lutyo yaPita naJoni, akale bakabona kuti, abajakabakabelinendayijo, belibanhu zwabo, bakachenama akale bakabaziba kuti bakabeli naJesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Koga pabakabona unhulume wakabachijwa elimile nabo, bakashayiwa indebo yokunyenyeja. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Koga pabakababhisa mugota kuti bende kuzhe, ibo bakasala begowana chabo chabo, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />beti, “Totani nabanhulume yaba? Ichokomende kuti chishamiso chikulwana chatiwa naibo akale bagali bomu Jelusalema bose banozwiziba, akale isu atingalambe. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Koga kuti zwisizhalilane mubanhu, ngatibatyisijileni nesimba kuti kuva nasi besilebeleke nezina lyaJesu kubanhu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nokudalo bakabashoba bakaba kalalila bebabuja kuti besilebeleke kana kulayija muzina lyaJesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Koga Pita naJoni bakabashandula beti, “Zwiyeyeleni mwoga kuti zwibuya ngezwipi, mbeli kwaMwali, kuwhilila imwi kana kuwhilila Mwali, pasunulani imwi, <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />isu apana zwatingalebeleke kuzhe kwezwatakabona akale nezwatakawha.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Pabakabatyisijila kabili, bakabasungunula kuti bende, bashayiwa inzila yokubalanga, betya banhu, nokuti banhu bose bakabekuja Mwali nezwakabatikana. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Unhulume wakachijwa wakabeli namakole anopinda makumi mana.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bavumili banonamatila myoyo misimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Pabakasungunulwa, bakenda kubakwaina babo bakabalondejela zwose zwabakabujwa nabatebuji bakulwana akale nabakulugulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Pabakazwiwha yezwi bakabuya pamwempela bakanyamula mawhi abo pamwempela kuna Mwali bakati, “She, uli Mwali wakabumba idenga, nenyika akale negungwa, naizwo zwose zwili mwazwili. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Nondomo watate bedu Davidi, undanda uwo wakati muMpepo uNchena, ini zwanyeteja bokuzhe, akale nabanhu, beyeya zwinhu zwisinanshingo!”<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Mashe enyika bakashangana nabatongi bakawhanana kulwisa She akale naKristo uwe.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Chokomende muguta yeli bakabaka bungana belwisa undanda uwo Jesu unchena, iwi uwakaguba, bose Helodi naPonsiyo Pilato pamwempela naBokuzhe akale nabanhu bokwaIzilayeli, <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />bakata zwiwakalonganya namaboko awo kuvila ntolo kutila kuti zwitikane. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Ngweno, She, ilinga kutyisijila kwabo, ipa bashingi babo myoyo isina lutyo kuti bepupule iwhi lilyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Kuti noluboko lulo lutandabujwe mukuchilisa, akale zwitondejelo nezwichenamiso zwitiwe muzina lyondanda uwo unchena Jesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Pabakapeja kunamata, bugalo bubakabeligele bwakadengunuka, bose bakazhajwa noMpepo Nchena akale bakapupula iwhi lyaMwali pesina kutya.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bavumili banokobelana zwibananazwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Ngweno ibunga lyabanhu lyakadimbwa likaba nomwoyo umwempela nompepo umwempela, apana unhu wakabeli nechiche, koga zwose zwakabeli zwabo bose. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Akale nesimba igulwana bapositoli bakapa busumikiji bwokumuka kwaShe Jesu munabakafa akale ishe jaMwali ihulwana jakaba kunaibo bose. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Apana wakabeshayiwa pakati pabo, nokuti bose bakababeli nemiminda nejingumba bakatengesa bakabuza imali yezwakabatengeswa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ikapilwa mumaboko abapositoli, ikakobanywa kuna umwe noumwe sokushayiwa kwabo. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Josefa wakapiwa untupo nabapositoli wokuti Bhanabhasi, (zwileba kuti mwananhulumyana woNsungwaji), unLevi unova kunyika yeSaipulasi, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />wakatengesa uminda uwe, akatola imali, akaibiga mumaboko abapositoli.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiyasi naSafila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Koga umwe unhulume unowhi Ananiyasi nonkaji uwe Safila, wakatengesa chikamu chefuma yiye, <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />akasiya imwe indipo, unkaji uwe ezwiziba, akabuza chikamu chendipo akachibiga mumaboko abapositoli. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Koga Pita wakati, “Ananiyasi, ini na ungwinwa naGuluzhanje kuti unyepele uMpepo Nchena akale usise imwe imali yominda uwo? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Seni wabeli minda uwo kojoba usanu watengesa ? Pawakati wontengesa, azwijabeli mumasimba awo na? Ini zwangwina mumwoyo uwo kuti unyepe ali? Aujaniepela banhu koga Mwali.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiyasi paakawha mawhi yaya wakawila pasi akafa. Naibo bose bakawha yezwi bakangwinwa nolutyo lukulwana. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Bazhuzha bakanyamuka, bakomputilija, bakounyamula bakanonjika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Kwapinda maawa angaba matatu, kwakaswika unkaji uwe esinoziba zwakabatikana. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Akale Pita wakati kwaali, “Ndibuje kana mwatengesa minda wenu nemali yeyi na!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Iye wakashandula eti, “Eya, nemali yakaleyo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Koga Pita wakati kwaali, “Mwazwita chini kugowana kuti mukweje uMpepo waTezi? Ilinga, makumbo aabo bajika undume uwo aipo pankoba, akale nawi banokunyamula benda nawi pazhe.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Pakalepo wakawila pasi pamakumbo aPita, akafa. Bazhuzha pabakabuya bakawana akafa, ndokuva bonyamula bakenda naye kuzhe bakonjika pelyo nondume uwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Lutyo lukulwana lwakangwina mugubungano lyose, akale nokunaibo bose bakazwiwha yezwi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zwichenamiso neZwishamiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ngweno zwitondejelo nezwichenamiso zwinji zwakatiwa mubanhu, namaboko abapositoli. Akale bose bakabeli pamwempela mugumbi linowhi Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Apana munaibo bakada kubatobela, koga banhu bakabalemekeja zwikulwana. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Banhulume nabanhukaji banji bakadimbwa munaShe bakawanda, <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />nokudalo bakabuza balwaji mujinzila jeguta, bakabalajika pabushasha, kuti kana Pita epinda, untuzi uwe uswike pabali. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Banhu bakabungana beva mumakuta alobakijana neJelusalema, bebuza bo balwaji nabakabejiijwa nemipepo mibi, bose bakachiliswa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bapositoli banoyabiswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Nokudalo untebuji unkulwana, wakanyamuka naabo bose baakabeli nabo, begapo lyabaSadusi, bakazhala ifupa, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />bakabasunga bapositoli bakababiga muntolongo lyabanhu koga. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Koga busiku ingilozi yaShe yakazhula matendele ejele ikababhisa ikati, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Indani, munoma mutempeli mulebeleke nabanhu mawhi wose obupenyu yobuno.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Pabakazwiwha yezwi, bakangwina mutempeli izhuba libhuda bakatanga kulayija.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Untebuji unkulwana wakezha nabo baakaba elinabo, akashoba igota lyabatongi bose boluji lwaIzilayeli, kukawhi bapositoli ngebenotolwa kuva kuntolongo <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Pabakenda batungamili babalindi, abajakabawana muntolongo, akale bakabwilila bakanobanyeulila, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />beti, “Tawana intolongo yakakonywa zwilosima, balindi bakalinda belimile pamikoba, koga patazhula tawana musina unhu mukati.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Bakati bazwiwha yezwi, untungamili wabalondoti betempeli nabatebuji bakulwana, bakakankabala kasakasa nezwabo, bechenama kuti yezwi zwinhu zwichapela chini. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Umwe wakezha akababuja eti, “Banhu bamwakabiga muntolongo, bamile mutempeli bakumulayija banhu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Untungamili wabalondoti betempeli nabatungamili babalindi bakenda kunobabuza pesina kukakabajana nokuti bakabetya kupubulwa nabanhu namabwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Pabakababuza bakabatula mbeli kwegota. Untebuji unkulwana wakababhuza, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />eti, “Takamulayisisa kuti musilayije pezhulu pezina lyaJesu, ilingani, hezwi mwazhaja iJelusalema yose nendayijo yenu, akale mumuda kuti ilopa lyoyu unhulume libe pezhulu pedu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Koga Pita nabapositoli bakashandula beti, “Tinokwelela kuwhilila Mwali kuna kuti tiwhilile banhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mwali wamatategulu edu wakomusa Jesu wamwakabulaya nokumpachika panti. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Mwali wakonyamula akombiga kuluboko lulwe lwokululyi soNtungamili akale soNchiji, kupa banhu bokwaIzilayeli lushanduko akale nokulekelelwa kwoluchinyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Isu tibasumikiji bezwi zwinhu, akale Mwali wakapa uMpepo uNchena kuna yabo banonwhilila.” <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Pabakawha yezwi bakanyetela kasa, bakada kubabulaya. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Koga, unFalisi mugota, izina lilye liwhi Gamaliyeli, eli undayiji wemilawo akale elemekejwa kasa nabanhu bose, wakabalaya kuti bebhise bapositoli kuzhe kwegota kwonshaji unshoma. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Wakati kwabali, “Imwi banhulume bokuIzilayeli, chenjelelani nezwamumuda kuta kunaba banhulume.” <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Nokuti kwapinda unshaji unshoma kwakamuka Teudasi ezwita unhu kasa, bamwe banhulume, baluswika posa mazana mana bakontobela, koga wakabulayiwa, nokudalo ibo bose batobeli babe bakatataukana, zwikabwandila. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />“Mushule moyu unhulume, Judasi wokuGalili wakamuka naiye mumazhuba okulabwa kwabanhu, akachenga banhu banji kuti beuntobele. Neebo wakafa akale bose bakabontobela bakapalalana. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Akale kunezwi zwangweno ndinoti kwamuli, banhulume yaba balekejeni, nokuti kana chilongwa yechi uli unshingo wonhu, zwinopelela mumpepo, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />koga kana zwili zwaMwali, amungazwikubukile. Mungoowana munyenyejana naMwali!” <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nokudalo bakawhilila chilayo chiche, akale pabakabashoba bapositoli kova bebakwaisa, bakabalaya kuti besilebeleke nezina lyaJesu, bakabalekeja benda zwabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Pabakabhuda pegota, bakashantilwa beti bawanikwa bakakwelela kuti beyabisilwe izina lilye. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Mazhuba ose mutempeli nomujingumba jose abajalekeja kulayija nokubhaunula kuti Jesu ndiye Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Babhanchi bashanu banababili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mumazhuba yayo, balayijwa pabakawanda, kwakaba nokunyunyuta pakati pabaJuda bakabelebeleka chiGiliki nabaHebhelu beti, inchilikaji jabo jakabesinokobelwa zwilobakwelela zwezhuba nezhuba. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Baligumi nababili bakashoba igubungano lyose lyabalayijwa bakati, “Azwilokwelela kuti tisiye kupupula iwhi lyaMwali, tibe banopakulila banhu kulya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Nokudalo banakwaina, ishalani mukati mwenu banhulume bashanu banababili, balojikama, bazhele uMpepo uNchena akale belina buchenjevu, batingabige kuta unshingo yoyu. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Koga isu tichazwipila mukunamata unshaji wose nokushingila iWhi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Yezwi zwabakaleba zwakashantisa igubungano lyose kova beshala Sitivini, unhulume wakabelizhele kudimbwa noMpepo Nchena, naFilipu, naPulokolasi, naNikano, naTimoni, naPaminasi, naNikolasi unhu wokuzhe wakabekashandukila kuchiJuda eva kuAntiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Yaba bakabuzwa mbeli kwabapositoli, kukanamatwa, bakababiga maboko abo pezhulu pabo<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Iwhi lyaMwali lyakendila mbeli, balayijwa bakawanda zwikulwana muJelusalema akale nabatebuji banji bakadimbwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusungwa kwaSitivini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Sitivini elizhele kudimbwa nesimba, wakata zwichenamiso nezwitondejelo zwikulwana mubanhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Bamwe besinagogi linowhi lyabaSungunuli (sokushobwa kwalyo), nabokuSayilini, nabokuAlekizandiliya nabanova kuSilisiya nokuEzhiya bakamilika bakakabajana naSitivini. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Koga abajakatubula kumilana nobuchenjevu akale noMpepo waakalebeleka nawo. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ibo bakakombeleja bamwe banhulume, musiswa kuti beti, “Isu takonwha elebeleka mawhi okutuka Mozesi naMwali.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Bakakunijila banhu nabakulwana bobugalo akale nabakwali, bakondila bakombhata kova bombuza mbeli kwegota, <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />bakamisa basumikiji bamaniepwa bakati, “Yoyu unhulume umundila mbeli elebeleka mawhi okutuka bugalo yobu buchena pamwempela nomulawu, <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />nokuti takonwha eti yoyu Jesu wokuNazaleta unoopalaja bugalo yobu, kova eshandula magalilo atakapiwa naMozesi.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bose bakabeli mugota, bakondingisisa bakabona chiso chiche chitojana nechengilozi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Indebo yaSitivini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Untebuji unkulwana wakabhuza Sitivini eti, “Yezwi zwinhu ichokomende na?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Sitivini wakashandula akati, “Banakwaina namatate, ndiwhilileni, Mwali wamasimba wakazwitondejela kuna tate bedu Abhulahamu echi kuMesopotamiya, esanhu agala kuHalani,” <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />wakati kwaali, “Ibhuda munyika yiyo nomumakamu awo, unde kunyika yandichakutondeja.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Pakalepo wakabhuda munyika yamaKaladiya akenda kunogala muHalani. Akale kuva yopo, tate babe pabakafa, Mwali bakoombuza munyika yeyi yamugele ngweno, <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />asi aajakompa ishabo munaiyo, kana pokutobela igumbo lilye, kojoba Abhulahamu esakabeli nomwana, Mwali wakabimbisa yeyi inyika kuchizekululu chichoontobela. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mwali wakaleba kuti chizekululu chichoogala munyika yabamwe, akale banootiwa bazike bakajiijwa kwamakole mazana mana. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Mwali wakati, inyika ichabata bazike unoyitongesa, akale mushule mwozwo banoobhuda yoko, bezha yokuno kondinamata. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Mwali wakompa chito chemhalajo. Nokudalo Abhulahamu wakazwala Isaki, akomhalaja mushule mwamazhuba mashanu ana matatu, Isaki wakazwala Jakobe, akale Jakobe akaba tate benduji igumi jinembili. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Matategulu bakaba nefupa pezhulu paJosefa, bakontengesa kuIjipiti. Koga Mwali wakabeli naye, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />akonchija mumasheto awe ose, akale akompa lubhancho nobuchenjevu mbeli kwaFalo, she wokuIjipiti, iye wakonta untongi weIjipiti nengumba yiye. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ngweno kwakaba nebhamba nokujiila kukulwana munyika yose yeIjipiti neKenani akale matategulu edu akashayiwa zwolya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Koga Jakobe paakawha kuti kuna zwilyo kuIjipiti, wakatuma matategulu edu mulwendo lwokutanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Palwendo lwabili Josefa wakazwizibisa kubakulu babe, nemhuli yaJosefa yakazibiswa kunaFalo. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Josefa wakatuma bakulu babe kunoshoba tate babe Jakobe namakamu awe, bakabeli makumi mashanu namabili anabanhu bashanu, <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />akale Jakobe wakabhuluka kuIjipiti. Wakafa, iye namatategulu edu, <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />bakanyamulwa bebwilizwa kuShekemu bakanojikwa mugumbu lyakabatengwa naAbhulahamu nendipilo yesiliva kubanabanhulumyana baHamo kuShekemu. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Koga unshaji wechibimbiso pawakasendela, unshaji wekowhe Mwali yaakata kuna Abhulahamu, banhu bakawanda bakazhalilana muIjipiti, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />kujina kukaswika umwe She usakaba eziba Josefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Yoyu unhu wakabhata bubi banhu bokunasu, wakasindamija matategulu edu, akabalashisa bana babo kuti besibe bapenyu. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Noyu unshaji Mozesi wakazwalwa, akale wakabeyebeka mbeli kwaMwali. Wakalelwa mungumba yatate babe kwemyeji mitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />akale paakabhutulwa, mwananhukajana waFalo wakontola akonkubusa somwananhulumyana uwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mozesi wakabakalayijwa kuchenjela kwose kwabanhu bomuIjipiti, akale elinesimba mumawhi nomuzwito. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Aba namakole makumi mana, zwakaswika mumwoyo uwe kuti eshanyile banakwaina babe, banabanhulumyana bokwaIzilayeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Paakabona umwe wabo ejiijwa, wakondwila undyambijwi, wakabwiliza nokuloba unJipite. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Wakayeya kuti makamu awe achawhisisa kuti Mwali uchabasungunula namaboko awe, koga abajakazwiwhisisa. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Muchimuka wakabaswikila, akawana babili bokunaibo belwana, akakweja kubalandula eti, “Banhulume, mumakamu, ini mulwana!” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Koga yoyo wakabachinyila umbakijani uwe wakonsundila kule eti, “Ndiyani wakuta untongi nombetesi pezhulu pedu?” <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />“Unoda kundibulaya sezwawakabulaya unJipite izhilo!” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Nendebo yeyo, Mozesi wakatizhila kunyika yeMidiyeni, akanogala kwakale, kwaakaba tate babana banhulumyana babili. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Ngweno pakwakapinda makole makumi mana, ingilozi yaShe yakazwitondeja kwaali muntutumo womoto pedenje, mugwegulu lyedunhu lyeSinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mozesi paakazwibona yezwi, wakachenama nezwaakabona, paakasendela kuti ebonesese, iwhi yaShe lyakawhika kwaali, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />liti, “Ndili Mwali wamatategulu awo, Mwali waAbhulahamu, waIsaki akale nowaJakobe.” Mozesi wakadedema aajakada kulinga. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />She wakati kwaali, “Imbula ishangu jijo, nokuti bugalo paumile buchena. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Chokomende ndabona kujiila kwabanhu bangu baimo muIjipiti ndikawha kumimila kwabo, ndabhuluka ndizha kobasungunula. Ngweno izha, ndikutume kuIjipiti.” <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Yoyu Mozesi ubakalamba beti, “Ndiyani wakakubiga kuba untongi akale nombetesi?” Ndiye Mwali wakontuma kuti ebe untongi nounsungunuli noluboko lwengilozi yakazwitondejela kwaali mudenje. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Wakababhisa muIjipiti, mushule mwokutondejela zwishamiso nezwitondejelo munyika yeIjipiti, nopeGungwa iShaba akale nomugwegulu kwamakole makumi ana mana. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Yoyu ndiye Mozesi wakati kubana baIzilayeli, “Mwali unoomupa uMpolofeti unova mubanakwaina benu unanga sami.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Yoyu ndiye waluba mugubungano lyomugwegulu eli nengilozi yakalebeleka naye peDunhu lyeSinai, akale namatategulu edu, wakatambula indebo jobupenyu kuti ejiswinche kwatili. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Matategulu edu bakalamba kunwhilila, akontukulila akabwilila kuIjipiti mumyoyo yabo, <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />beti kunaAloni, “Tibumbile baMwali bachatitungamilila, koga yoyu Mozesi wakatibhisa munyika yoku Ijipiti, atichinoziba zwatikana kwaali.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Munayo mazhuba, bakabumba inamani, bakapila untebulo kuchibumbwa, akale bakashantila mishingo yamaboko abo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Koga Mwali wakabatukulila akabasiya benamata zwibumbwa zwokudenga, sezwazwilokwalwa mulukwalo lwabapolofeti kuti, “Mwakandipila umpilo wemhuka jimwakabulaya kana untebulo kwamakole makumi mana mugwegulu, Imwi bengumba yaIzilayeli, <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Imwi mwakatola itente lyaMoloki, nenyenyeji jechimwali Lefani, zwibumbwa zwamwakata kuti muzwinamate akale ndomubhisa ndimusenge kuseli kweBhabhiloni.” <verse eid="ACT 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Matategulu edu bakabeli netente lyechisumikijo mugwegulu, lyaluba namabakilo akalayijwa naMwali kunaMozesi sokulayila kwaakata. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Matategulu edu, akalitambula, akalibuza munyika yabakatola kunejimwe induji betungamililwa naJoshuwa, ndikwo kulyakabeli, kuswikila unshaji waDavidi, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />iye wakawana kudiwa naMwali akale akakumbila kuwanila bugalo Mwali waJakobe. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Koga Solomoni ndiye wakabakila Mwali ingumba. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Kojoba alo, Iye upezhuluzhulu aatogala mujingumba jinobakwa namaboko abanhu, sezwakalebwa nompolofeti kuti, <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Idenga chigalo changu chobushe, inyika chibhula chamakumbo angu. Ingumba ni yauchandibakila, kana kuti ini bugalo bonyetutukwa kwangu? Ndizwo zwimulebwa naShe.” <verse eid="ACT 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />“Alutoba luboko lwangu lwakabumba zwinhu zwose yezwi na? <verse eid="ACT 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Imwi balokoma misholo, basakamhalajwa mumyoyo nenzebe, munolamba uMpepo uNchena sezwakata matategulu enu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ndiupi umpolofeti usakasheteswa namatategulu enu? Akale bakabulaya yabo bakalebambeli kuzha kwaiye ulolulama, uli iye ngweno umwakacheta mukabulaya, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />imwi mwakatambula mulawo mutungamilwa nengilozi jaMwali koga amujakontobeleja.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupubulwa kwaSitivini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Pabakazwiwha yezwi, bakalwajilwa mumyoyo, bakondumila intwino. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Koga iye, ekazhajwa noMpepo uNchena, wakalinga kudenga akabona kungaima kwaMwali, akale Jesu elimile kuluboko lwokululyi lwaMwali, <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />akati, “Lingani, ndibweni idenga lyazhulwa akale mwananhulumyana wonhu elimile kuluboko lwokululyi lwaMwali!” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Koga bakashomeja newhi lipopezhulu, bakazuna inzebe bakondabukila beli pamwempela. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Bakonkuluntila kuzhe kweguta bakompubula namabwe, nabasumikiji bakabiga zwimbalo zwabo pamakumbo omwe unzhuzha waluwhi Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Pabakabompubula namabwe Sitivini, iye wakashomeja kunaMwali eti, “Tezi Jesu, tambulani umpepo wangu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Wakafhigama, akakongoloka newhi lipopezhulu, eti, “Tezi, musibape undandu nechi chibi.” Paakapeja kulebeleka yezwi, wakafa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Saulu wakaba evuma kuti Sitivini ebulayiwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saulu unoyabisa igubungano</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Nelyo izhuba kwakaba nokusheteswa kukulwana kwegubungano muJelusalema; akale ibo bakatataukana mujinyika jeJudiya neSamaliya, kuzhe kwabapositoli. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Banhulume balodimbwa ndibo bakajika Sitivini, bakondila kasa zwineshungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Koga Saulu wakaba epalaja igubungano, engwina mungumba nengumba, ekulunta banhulume nabanhukaji ebabiga muntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ngweno yabo bakatataukana bakenda bebhaunula iwhi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipu wakenda kuguta lyomuSamaliya akanobapupulila Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Akale, luvute nomwoyo umwempela lwakawha lukatobela zwakabelebwa naFilipu, bewha nokubona zwitondejelo zwaakabeta. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mipepo ineshambwa yakakwiila ibhuda mubanhu akale banji balokokonyala nabalolemala bakachiliswa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Nokudalo kwakaba nolushanto lukulwana muguta yelyo. <verse eid="ACT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Koga mwakabeli nonhulume waluwhi Simoni walusota masalamusi, wakachenamisa banhu bomuSamaliya, ezwiti iye unhu unkulwana kasa. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Bose bakaba bonwhilila, kuvila kubatukutuku zwinda kubakulwana, beti, “Yoyu unhulume, masimba aMwali anowhi maKulugulu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bakonwhilila, nokuti kwonshaji undefu wakabebachenamisa namasalamusi awe. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Koga pabakadimbwa kubhaunula kwaFilipu kweNdebo iMbuya yobushe bwaMwali, nezina lyaJesu Kristo, bakabhabhatizwa, bose banhulume nabanhukaji. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Kana iye Simoni emene wakadimbwa, akale paakabhabhatizwa wakatobela Filipu. Paakabona zwitondejelo nezwishamiso zwikulwana zwakabetiwa, wakachenama. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ngweno bapositoli baluba belikuJelusalema pabakawha kuti iSamaliya yalitambula iwhi lya Mwali, bakatumila kwabali Pita naJoni, <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />bakadelela kwabali kwabakaswika bakanamata nabo kuti betambule uMpepo Nchena, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />nokuti aujakabanu wabhulukila kana kumwempela wabo, koga bakaba bhabhatizwa muzina lyaShe Jesu chete. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Bakabiga maboko abo pezhulu pabo, bakatambula uMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ngweno Simoni paakabona kuti uMpepo Nchena unopiwa nokubigwa maboko nabapositoli wakabhisa imali, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />eti “Ndipeni bo isimba yeli kuti aani naani wandinobiga maboko pezhulu pape, etambule uMpepo Nchena.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Koga Pita wakati kwaali, “Isiliva lilyo lipalale nawi, nokuti unolangalila kuti chipo chaMwali ungachitenga ne mali! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Iwi auna chikamu kana inkobelo pana yezwi, nokuti moyo uwo aujilolulama mbeli kwaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Shanduka kunobu bubi bubo, unamate kunaShe, pamwe ungawana kulekelelwa pechinangwa chomoyo uwo. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nokuti ndibweni kuti wafundilila nolubengo luna luchibo nokusungwa nechibi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni wakashandula eti, “Ndinamatileni kunaShe, kuti zwamwaleba zwisitikane kwandili.” <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ngweno pabakapa busumikiji akale babhaunula iwhi lyaShe, bakabwilila kuJelusalema, bepupula iNdebo iMbuya mumisha minji yamaSamaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Filipu nontungamili wokuEtopiya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ingilozi yaShe yakati kunaFilipu, “Nyamuka unde kuchamhembe, kungwagwa unova kuJelusalema unda kuGaza.” Yoyu ungwagwa womugwegulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Wakanyamuka akenda. Feno unhu wokuEtopiya, unsunyulwi akale eli umbhati wehobhodo yaKandisi, Shekaji wamaEtopiya, wakabezha kuJelusalema konamata, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />elimukubwilila, eligele mungolo yiye, elimukubala lukwalo lwompolofita Izaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />UMpepo wakati kunaFilipu, “Inda unokwendesana nengolo yeyi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Nokudalo Filipu wakalabukila kungolo, akawha unsunyulwi ebala lukwalo lwaIzaya, akabhuza eti, “Ukumuwhisisa na zwaumubala?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Iye wakati, “Ndingawhisisa chini, kuzhe kwokuti umwe enditondeje?” Wakonkumbila Filipu kuti engwine muchikochikala chiche begale bose. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Wakaba ebala iNdebo yeyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Wakatungamijwa semhwizi ikumunda kunobulayiwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">semhwizana ilowhilijila mbeli kwombulayi wayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">sezwo aajakazhula undomo uwe.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Mukulelupiswa kukwe aajakawana indulamo imbuya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ndiyani angabandulula ijanja lilye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Nokuti bupenyu bubwe bunotolwa kuva munyika.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Unsunyulwi wakati kuna Filipu, “Umpolofeti umuleba akananga aani munezwi zwose, ndibuje, umuzwileba iye kana umuva umwe unhu?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Kova Filipu ezhula undomo uwe elebeleka, etangisa newhalo inchena yaIzaya akombuja neNdebo iMbuya yaJesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bechinokwenda nongwagwa bakaswika panevula, unsunyulwi akati, “Linga heyi ivula. Ini zwingandikoneja kuti ndibhabhatizwe?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Akale Filipu wakati, “Kana udimbwa nomwoyo uwo wose, ungabhabhatizwa.” Akale wakashandula eti, “Ndinodimbwa kuti Jesu Kristo Mwananhulumyana waMwali.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Wakamisa chikochikala chiche, belibabili bakenda muvula, Filipu akabhabhatiza unsunyulwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Pabakabhuda muvula, uMpepo waShe wakontola Filipu, unsunyulwi aajakoombona, akendila mbeli nolwendo lulwe ekashanta. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipu wakazwiwana abakuAzotasi, akapinda enda ebhaunula iNdebo iMbuya mumizinda yose akajina akanoswika kuSizaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kushanduka kwaSaulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Mishingo 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Koga Saulu elya moto akale ebimbisa lufu kubalayijwa baShe, wakenda kubatebuji bakulwana <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />akakumbila makwalo okunda kusinagogi yokuDamasikasi, kuti angowana batobeli beNzila, banhulume nabanhukaji, ebabuze kuJelusalema bakasungwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ngweno elimunzila, mulwendo lulwe, abapelyo neDamasikasi, pakalepo lupenyo lwakava kudenga lukomunikila. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Wakawila pasi akawha iwhi liti kunaiye, “Saulu, Saulu, unondinyajilani?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saulu wakashandula akati, “Ndimwi aani, Tezi?” Akati, “Ndimi, Jesu, waumuyabisa, <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />asi inyamuka ungwine muguta, mwauchanobujwa zwokuta.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Banhulume baakabekwenda nabo bakama besina mawhi mundomo, beliwhile iwhi koga pesina unhu wabamubona. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saulu wakamilika pasi, paakazhulika mesho awe, apana chaakabona, nokudalo bakontungamilila bakombata luboko bonsenga muDamasikasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Wakata mazhuba matatu esinobona kana kulya kana kunwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Kwakabeli nondayijwa muDamasikasi, wakabewhi Ananiyasi. She wakalebeleka naye muchibono akati, “Ananiyasi,” Iye wakadabila eti, “Ndipo yopano She.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Tezi wakati kwaali, “Nyamuka unde kungwagwa, unowhi Lulama, unoshaka mungumba yaJudasi, unhulume wokuTasusi izina lilye unowhi Saulu, unoungwana elikumunamata, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />akale iye wabona unhulume unowhi Ananiyasi, ezha kobiga maboko pezhulu pape kuti ebone akale.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Koga Ananiyasi wakashandula eti, “She, ndakawha nabanji nezwoyu unhu, bubi bwaakata kubachena benu bokuJelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />akale yopano ulopiwa masimba nabatebuji bakulwana, kusunga bose banoshoba izina lyenu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Koga iye She wakati kwaali, “Inda, yoyu chishingiso changu chindashala, kuti chisume izina lyangu kubanhu bokuzhe akale kumashe nokubana baIzilayeli, <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />nokudalo ndichontondeja kuti unoosheteselwa chini pezhulu pezina lyangu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Nokudalo, Ananiyasi wakanyamuka akenda kuneyo ingumba. Paakombiga maboko wakati kwaali, “Mwanakwaina Saulu, She Jesu wakazwitondejela kwauli mungwagwa uwakezha nawo, wandituma kuti uchiliswe ubone akale uzhajwe noMpepo Nchena.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Pakalepo kwakambwela zwinanga mapande ehobe zwiva mumesho awe ndokuva mesho awe akabona. Wakanyamuka akabhabhatizwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />wakalya akawana isimba. Kwamazhuba wakaba nabalayijwa muDamasikasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Eli mumasinagogo, wakapupula eti, Jesu ndiye mwananhulumyana waMwali. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Bose bakonwha bakachenama beti, “Aatoba iye yoyu unhulume wakabeyabisa yabo banoshoba yeli izina kuJelusalema na? Ndizwo zwakabezhila yokuno, ebatola ebasenga bakasungwa kubatebuji bakulwana na.” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Koga Saulu, wakakubuka kasa mumasimba, akale akachenamisa baJuda banogala muDamasikasi nokusimatija kuti Jesu ndiye Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Kwapinda mazhuba manji, maJuda bakagowana kuti bombulaye, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />koga chilangano chabo chakaswika munzebe jaSaulu. Bakalinda ishubo busiku namasikati, kuti bombulaye, <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />koga balayijwa babe bakombhuluja busiku, bakondeleja pabulambo eli muchizuma.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saulu muJelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Paakaswika kuJelusalema wakakweja kushinga pamwempela nabalayijwa, asi bose bakabontya, nokuti abajakabedimbwa kuti waaba undayijwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Koga Bhanabhasi wakontola, akenda naye kubapositoli, akabazibisa kuti elimungwagwa wakabona chini She Jesu, akalebeleka naye, akale nokuti wakabhaunula chini izina lyaJesu kuDamasikasi nomwoyo usina lutyo. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Nokudalo wakangwinuka mukati mwabo muJelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />ebhaunula izina lyaShe Jesu esina lutyo. Iye wakalebeleka enyenyejana nabaJuda balulebeleka chiGiliki, ibo bakashaka kuumbulaya. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Banakwaina babe pabakazwiziba yezwi, bakonsenga pasi kuKesaliya, kwaakapindilijwa etumwa kuTasusi. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Igubungano lyose muJudiya, nomuGalili akale muSamaliya lyakaba nolunyalalo, likakubuswa; akale likwenda mulutyo lwaShe nomulunyalalo lwoMpepo Nchena. <verse eid="ACT 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Pita ekwenda yopa nopa mukati mwaibo bose bachena, wakaswika kubachena bomubugalo bweLida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Yomu wakawana unhulume unowhi Eniyasi, wakabeli igosha kwamakole mashanu anamatatu. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Pita wakati kwaali, “Eniyasi, Jesu Kristo umukuchilisa; nyamuka ulonganye bushasha bubo.” Pakalepo wakanyamuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Bagali bomuLida neShaloni bakombona, bose bakashanduka bakadimbwa munaShe. <verse eid="ACT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ngweno, pakabeli nondayijwa wechinhukaji kuJopa waluwhi Tabita, zwileba kuti Dokasi. Wakabeli unhukaji unamishingo mibuya akale eta zwito zwokubhancha basheti. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Munayo mazhuba wakalwala kova eshayika, pabakonshambisa bakombiga mungumba yopezhulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Sezwo iLida yakaba ili pelyo neJopa, balayijwa, pabakawha kuti Pita wakaba eliko, bakatuma banhulume babili kunda kwaali kuti benoombweta beti, “Nchenche swika kwatili usijilwe.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Nokudalo Pita wakanyamuka akenda nabo. Aswika, bakonsenga mungumba ipopezhulu. Inchilikaji jose jakabelimile pelyo naPita jilila, jiuntondeja zwimbalo neshashiko, zwakaba zwatiwa naDokasi eliumpenyu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Koga Pita wakababhisa bose mungumba, akafhigama akanamata, kova eshanduka elinga kuntumbu eti, “Tabita imuka.” Iye wakabhwazula, paakabona Pita wakamuka akagala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Pita wakatambunuja luboko lulwe akonyamula. Pakalepo wakashoba bachena nenchilikaji akombiga mbeli kwabo eli umpenyu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Yezwi zwakazibikana iJopa yose, akale banji bakadimbwa munaShe. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Pita wakagala mazhuba manji muJopa, egala naSimoni, unchuki.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Pita naKoneliyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />KuKesaliya kwakebeli nonhulume waluwhi Koneliyasi, untungamili wezana lyabalwi baluwhi Igapo lyamaNtaliyana, <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />unhulume wakabakazwipila akale walutya Mwali nemhuli iye yose, wakaba epa zwipo nomwoyo unchena kubanhu, akale enamata unshaji wose kunaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Nonshaji ungaba weawa lyeshanu linamana lyezhuba, wakabona mumbono ingilozi yaMwali ingwina ikati kwaali, “Koneliyasi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Wakaitokoloja nolutyo akati, “Ini Tezi?” Yakati kwaali, “Minamato yiyo nokupa kuko zwatanha zwikaswika zwikaba sechikumbulujo mbeli kwaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Ngweno ituma banhulume kuJopa, benoshoba Simoni unowhi Pita, <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />ugele naSimoni, unchuki wamapapata, unengumba ipo pelyo negugwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Mushule mwokulebeleka naye wakenda untumwa waMwali, akashoba bashingi babe babili nondwi umwempela unoda Mwali wakabonshingila, <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />paakabalungululila zwose ibo, wakabatuma kuJopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Muchimuka, belimunzila babapelyo neguta, Pita wakenda pezhulu pengumba kunonamata, nonshaji weawa lyeshanu lina limwempela. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Wakaba nenzhala, akada chokulya, bakati bechinobhika wakaba sowalala ihope, <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />akabona idenga lizhulika, kudelejwa chinhu chinanga uncheka, kumapazu mana enyika. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Munyika mwakabeli nenduji jose jemhuka namakabi nenyuni jedenga. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Iwhi lyakati kwaali, “Pita, nyamuka, bulaya ulye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Koga Pita wakati, “Ne, She, andijanu ndalya chinhu cheshambwa kana chiloswibha.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Iwhi lyakati kwaali kabili, “Zwilocheneswa naMwali, iwi usizwiti ishambwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Yezwi zwakatikana katatu, akale chinanga uncheka chakabwilizwa kudenga pakalepo.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Ngweno Pita, echakakankabala, kuti chibono yechi chinolebani, kwakaswika banhulume bakaba batumwa naKoneliyasi belimile mbeli kweshubo, bebhuza kungumba kwaSimoni, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />bakashomeja bebhuza kuti ndipo panogala Simoni unowhi Pita na!<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Pita echinoyeya zwechibono, uMpepo wakati kwaali, “Linga pana banhulume batatu bakumukupyanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Nyamuka udelele, unde nabo usinokahajika; nokuti ndimi ndabatuma.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Pita wakabhuluka akenda kwabali banhulume yaba akati kwabali, “Ndimi wamumupyanga, ini zwamubuza yokuno!”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ibo bakati, “Koneliyasi untungamili wezana lyabalwi unhulume ulolulama akale etya Mwali, unezina ibuyanana kuluji lwose lwabaJuda, wakalayilwa nengilozi inchena kuti iwi, unde kungumba yiye, kuti ewhe zwauchaleba.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Nokudalo, bakangwina mungumba bakaba bezi babe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Muchimuka, Pita wakamuka akenda nabo, pamwempela nabamwe banakwaina bokuJopa, bakompelekeja <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Nezhuba linotobela bakangwina muKesaliya. Koneliyasi wakabakabamilila akale ashoba nokubuza pamwempela makamu awe nabakwaina babe banodikana. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Pita paakangwina, Koneliyasi wakontandamija akawila pasi pamakumbo awe akomfhugamila. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Koga Pita, wakonyamula eti, “Milika, imi neebo ndinhu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Echinolebeleka naye, wakangwina mungumba akawana banhu banji babungana, <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />akati kwabali, “Imwi mose munoziba kuti mulawo unojibisa kushangana kana kushanyilana kwabaJuda nabokuzhe, koga Mwali wanditondeja kuti anditokwelela kuti nditi umwe unhu uneshambwa kana kuti uloswibha. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Nokudalo pandatumilwa banhu, ndezha ndisinokahajika. Ngweno ndimubhuza kuti ini zwawandishobela!”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koneliyasi wakati, “Mazhuba mana apinda, nonshaji wakalono, ndakabechengeta iawa yeshanu nena yokunamata mungumba mwangu, pakalepo ndakabona unhulume elimile mbeli kwangu ekambala ingubo jinopenya, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />wakati, ‘Koneliyasi, unamato uwo wawhikwa nezwipo zwizwo, Mwali wakuyeya. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Nokudalo ituma banhu bende kuJopa benoshoba Simoni unowhi Pita, ugele pengumba yaSimoni, unchuki wamapapata, unengumba pelyo negungwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ndizwo ndatuma banhu nokukambijisa kwauli, akale wata zwibuya ukezha. Nokudalo ngweno tose tipo yopano mbeli kwamesho aMwali, kuti tiwhe zwose zwawalayiwa naTezi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indebo yaPita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Pita wakashamula undomo uwe akati, “Chokomende ndawhisisa kuti Mwali aatoshalula, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />koga muluji kana lupi zwalo, yoyo unootya Mwali akale eta zwakalulama unotambulika kwaali. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Munoliziba iwhi lyaakatumila kunaIzilayeli, kubhaunula iNdebo iMbuya yolunyalalo yaJesu Kristo, (Iye ndiShe waizo zwose), <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />iwhi lyakapupulwa muJudiya yose, kutangisila kuGalili, mushule molubhabhatizo lwakabhaunulwa naJoni, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />kuti Mwali wakonguba chini Jesu wokuNazaleta noMpepo Nchena akale nesimba, akale wakabenda eta chini zwibuyanana akale echilisa bose bakabaka sindamijwa naGuluzhanje, nokuti Mwali wakabeli naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Isu tibasumikiji kunaizwo zwose zwaakata munyika yabaJuda akale nomuJelusalema. Bakombulaya nokundengeleja ponti, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />koga Mwali wakomusa nezhuba lyatatu, ndiko kuti eboneswe, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />kusi kubanhu bose koga kunasu isu takashalwa naMwali kuti tibe basumikiji, tikalya tikanwa naye mushule mwokumuka kukwe kubafi. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Wakatilaya kuti tibhaunule kubanhu, akale kuti tisumikije kuti ndiye wakagajwa naMwali kuti ebe untongi wabapenyu nabakafa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Kunaiye bose bapolofeti banosumikija kuti, wose unodimbwa kwaali unowana kulekejelwa kwoluchinyo muzina lilye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bokuzhe banotambula uMpepo uNchena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Pita echinolebeleka yezwi, uMpepo Nchena wakabhulukila pana bose wakawha indebo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Bavumili bakabeva kunayabo balomhalajwa bakabezha naPita bakachenama, nokuti chipo choMpepo Nchena chakabhulukila kunaBokuzhe. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Nokuti bakabawha belebeleka nendimi akale bekuja Mwali. Pita omene wakati, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“ Upo na angalambija kuti kuwanike ivula kuti banhu yaba, batambula uMpepo Nchena sasu, bebhabhatizwe?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Wakabalaya kuti bebhabhatizwe muzina lyaJesu Kristo. Ibo bakonkumbila kuti ebenabo kwamazhuba.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Chiwijo chaPita kuGubungano lyokuJelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Bapositoli nabanakwaina bakabegala kuJudiya bakawha kuti Bokuzhe bakatambula iwhi lyaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Nokudalo Pita paakenda kuJelusalema, yabo begapo lyemhalajo bakanyenyejana naye, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />beti, “Iwi wakendilani kubanhulume basilomhalajwa, akale ukalya nabo?” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Koga Pita wakatanga akababujisisa munzila ilolonganyika: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ndakaba ndili muguta lyeJopa ndinamata, akale sonhu umulota ndakabona chibono, chinanga uncheka unkulwana udelejwa uva kudenga ukabhatwa mapazu mana, ukezha kwandili. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Pandakalingisisa, ndakabona imhuka jenyika nezwibanda, namakabi akale nenyuni jinopululuka. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ndakawha iwhi liti kwandili, ‘Nyamuka Pita, bulaya akale ulye.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Koga imi ndakati, ‘Ne, Tezi akuna chinhu cheshambwa kana chiloswibha chanuchangwina mundomo mwangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Koga iwhi lyakandishandula kabili, liva kudenga liti ‘zwacheneswa naMwali usizwiti zwineshambwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Yezwi zwakatikana lutatu, akale zwose zwabwilizwa akale kudenga. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Noyo unshaji, banhulume batatu bakaswika pengumba pataluba, batumwa kwandili beva kuKesaliya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />UMpepo wakandibuja kuti ndinde nabo, ndisina lushalulo. Yaba banakwaina bashanu banamwempela naibo bakandipelekeja, akale tikangwina mungumba yonhulume yoyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Iye wakatibuja nokubona kukwe ingilozi ilimile mungumba yiye eti, ‘Tuma umwe kuJopa, enoshoba Simoni unowhi Pita, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />iye unokuzibisa chilayilo chichakuchija iwi nemhuli yiyo yose. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Pandakatangisa kulebeleka, uMpepo Nchena wakabhulukila pabali, sezwakatikana kwatili pakutanga.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ndakakumbulukwa mawhi aShe, kuti wakati, ‘Joni wakabhabhatiza nevula koga imwi munoobhabhatizwa noMpepo Nchena.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Kana, Mwali akabapa chipo chimwempela nasu patakadimbwa munaShe Jesu Kristo, imi ndimi aani kuti ndijibise Mwali?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pabakawha yezwi bakawhilijiswa. Ibo bakakuja Mwali beti, “Ngweno Mwali wapa bokuzhe naibo kuti beshandukile kubupenyu.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igubungano lyokuAntioki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ngweno yabo bakatatauswa nenjabiso yakatikana pezhulu paSitivini, bakenda bakanoswika kuFonisiya akale kuSaipulasi akale nokuAntiyoki, belebeleka iwhi kubaJuda chete. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Koga pakabeli nabamwe babo, banhulume bokuSaipulasi akale nabokuSayilini pabakaswika kuAntiyoki bakalebeleka nabaGiliki bebhaunula nezwaShe Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Luboko lwaShe lwakabeli nabo, akale banhu banji bakadimbwa bakashandukila kunaShe. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Indebo yeyi yakaswika munzebe jegubungano lyokuJelusalema akale bakatuma Bhanabhasi kuAntiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Paakaswika wakabona chipiwo chaMwali, wakashanta akale akabasungwaja kuti begale bakabimbika kunaShe nokuzwipila nomwoyo unsimu; <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />nokuti iye wakaba eli unhulume umbuya, uzhele noMpepo Nchena akale nokudimbwa. Banhu banji bakazwibuza kunaShe. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Nokudalo Bhanabhasi wakenda kuTasusi kunopyanga Saulu, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />paakongwana, wakombuza kuAntiyoki. Kwegole lyose, bakashangana nabegubungano, belayija igapo igulwana, muAntiyoki ndikwo kwakatanga balayijwa kuwhi, maKristo. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Munayo mazhuba bapolofeti bakenda kuAntiyoki beva kuJelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Umwe wabo waluwhi Agabhasi, wakamilika akapolofita, ebujwa noMpepo kuti kunooba nebhamba igulwana munyika jopasi lyose, yezwi zwakatikana mumazhuba obutongi bwaKilaudiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Umwe noumwe wabalayijwa wakazwipila, mwaanotubulila, kutumija lubhancho kubanakwaina bakabegala kuJudiya, <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />bakazwita yezwi, bakatumila Bhanabhasi naSaulu kuti benozwiswincha kubakulwana.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Kuyabiswa kunondila mbeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Nooyo unshaji She Helodi, wakabhata nolunya bamwe begubungano kuti ebashetese. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Wakabulaya Jemusi unkulu waJohani negwalabaza, <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />akale paakabona kuti zwakashantisa baJuda, wakava akasunga Pita neebo. Yaya akaba elimazhuba echinkwa chisina umfufumuso. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Paakonsunga, wakombiga muntolongo, akompila kumakapo mana abalwi kuti bondinde, elinendangalilo jokuti mushule mwePasika unoonsenga kubanhu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Nezwo Pita wakalondotwa muntolongo; ibo begubungano bakasungwalila kuunamatila nesimba kunaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Busiku bwakalebo, bwezhuba lyokuwhi Helodi walumisa pambeli pabanhu, Pita wakabelilele pakati pabalwi babili, akasungwa namaketani mabili, nabalindi mbeli konkoba bakalinda ijele, <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />ingilozi yaShe yakaswika, mukaba nokuchena muntolongo, ikazobanya Pita nopamapi awe iumusa iti, “Muka nokukambija.” Pakalepo maketani kumaboko akambwela. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ingilozi yakati kwaali, “Mbala akale umbale zwikwabaila zwizwo,” Iye wakata alo. Ikati akale, “Hingija ishashiko yiyo unditobele.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Yakabhuda akatobela, aajakaziba kuti zwimutiwa nengilozi ichokomende, wakayeya kuti ukumubona chibono. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Pabakapinda undindi wotanga akale nondindi wabili, bakaswika peshubo lyensimbi palubhudwa napo ungwina muguta. Lyakazhulika lyoga, akale ibo bakabhuda pabakati baswika pemhalalano jenzila jomuguta, pakalepo ingilozi yakonsiya. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Pita wakazhulika mesho akati, “Ngweno ndinechokomende kuti She watuma ingilozi yiye kuti yondimunula mumaboko aHelodi akale nomunazwose zwakabakalindwa nabanhu bechiJuda.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Paakaziba alo, wakenda kungumba yaMariya, amai baJohani, unowhibo Mako, kwakabakashangana banji pamwempela benamata. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Paakagogoja pankoba weshubo, undandakaji waluwhi Roda wakenda kunodabila. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Paakaziba iwhi lyaPita, nolushanto aajakazhula ishubo, koga wakalabuka kunobuja bamwe kuti Pita umile peshubo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ibo bakati kwaali, “Unopenga.” Koga iye wakasimisa eti ndimo. Bamwe bakati, “Untumwa waMwali uwe!” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Koga Pita wakendilambeli egogoja, pabakazhula bakombona, bakachenama. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Wakabanyalaja noluboko akabalungululila kuti She wakombhisa chini muntolongo. Wakati akale, “Mubuje Jemusi nabamwe banakwaina yezwi.” Wakava anyamuka enda kunobumwe bugalo. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ngweno pakwakeja, kwakaba nenyonganyonga pakati pabalwi kuti ini zwatikana kunaPita. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helodi paakompyanga wakonshayiwa, ndokuva abhuzisisa balindi akale akapa chilayilo chokuti bebulayiwe. Iye wakabhuda muJudiya enda kuKesaliya akanogala kwakale. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Ngweno, Helodi wakanyemela banhu bokuTayi akale neSidoni, ibo bakenda kwaali liligapo bakankombeleja unshingi uwe unkulwana unowhi Bhulasitasi, bakakumbila lunyalalo, nokuti inyika yabo yakabewana zwokulya kunyika yashe. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Nezhuba lyakabakalongwa Helodi wakambala zwimbalo zwizwe zwobushe, akagala pechigalo chobutongi, akalebeleka kwabali. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Banhu bakakongoloka beti, “Yeli iwhi lyaMwali alitoba lyonhu!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Pakalepo untumwa waTezi wakondoba nokuti aajakapa lukujo kunaMwali, wakafa akalyiwa nehonye. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Koga iwhi lyaMwali lyakakubuka akale likawandilana. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Bhanabhasi naSaulu bakabuya beva kuJelusalema, bazhajikija mishingo yabo, bakezha naJoni unalimwe izina linowhi Mako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Bhanabhasi naSaulu bakashalwa akale bakatumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ngweno mugubungano lyokuAntiyoki kwakabeli nabapolofeti akale nabalayiji saBhanabhasi, Simiyoni wakabewhi Naija, Lusiyasi wokuSayilini, Manaeni umwe igulukota wegota lyaHelodi untongi naSaulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Belimukunamata kunaShe, akale bezwiminya kulya, uMpepo Nchena wakati, “Ndipambulileni Bhanabhasi naSaulu benota unshingo wandabashobela.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Pabapeja kuzwiminya kulya nokunamata, bakababiga maboko abo pezhulu pabo bakabatumijila.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuSaipulasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Nokuti bakatumwa noMpepo Nchena, bakenda kuSeleusiya, akale kuva yoko bakenda nobwato kuSaipulasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Pabakaswika kuSalamisi, bakapupula iwhi lyaMwali mumasinagogo abaJuda. Bakabeli naJoni sombhanchi wabo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Pabakati bakwenda chibongo chose, bakaswika kuPafosi bakawana umwe unhu wamasalamusi, umpolofeti wamaniepwa eli unJuda, waluwhi Bha-Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Wakabeli nontongi wechikamu chenyika waluwhi, Sejiyasi Paulusi, unhulume unabuchenjevu, iye wakashoba Bhanabhasi naSaulu akale akada kuwha iwhi lyaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Koga, Elimasi wamasalamusi (ndizwo zwalinoleba izina lilye), wakabanyenyeja eshaka kubhisa untongi wechikamu chenyika mukudimbwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Koga Saulu, unowhi akale Paulu, azhajwa noMpepo Nchena wakontokoloja, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />akati, “Iwi mwananhulumyana waGuluzhanje, iwi umbengi wobululami bose, uzhele buchengeji nobubi, aungaleke kulashisa inzila iloti twisi yaShe? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Akale ngweno ziba kuti, luboko lwaShe lupo panawi akale unoba ibhofu akale usinobona izhuba kwonshaji.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Pakalepo ifulele nenhilima zwakawila pana iye, akenda eshaka banhu kuti bombhate luboko bontungamile. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Pakalepo untongi wechikamu chenyika wakadimbwa, paakabona zwakatikana, akale wakachenamiswa nendayijo yaTezi.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuAntiyoko muPisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paulu nabamwe babe bakakwenda nobwato kuva kuPafosi bakaswika kuPega imo muPamfiliya. Joni wakabasiya akabwilila kuJelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />koga ibo bakapinda muPega bakaswika kuAntiyoki yokuPisidiya. Nezhuba lyeSabata bakenda musinagogi bakagala pasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Pakwakapela kubalwa kwemilawu namakwalo abapolofeti, batongi besinagogi bakatumija kwabali iwhi beti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:15">“Banakwaina kana muli newhi lyokusungwaja banhu, lilebeni.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Nokudalo Paulu wakanyamuka, akamisa luboko lulwe akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Banhu bomuIzilayeli, akale namwi munotya Mwali, ndiwheni! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mwali wayaba banhu, baIzilayeli, wakashala matategulu edu akabata banhu bakulwana nonshaji wokugala kwabo muIjipiti. Akale noluboko lunesimba wakabatungamila ebabhisa munyika. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kwamakole angaba makumi mana belimugwegulu, wakabatungamila nomwoyo undefu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Paakapalaja induji ishanu jinembili munyika yeKenani. Wakabapa inyika yeyo seshabo lyabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Yezwi zwakaba zwamakole mazana mana anamakumi mashanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Mushule mwezwo, wakabapa batongi kuswika kuna Samiyele, umpolofeti. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Kova bekumbila She. Mwali akabapa Saulu mwananhulumyana waKishi, unhulume woluji lwaBhenjamini, kwamakole makumi mana. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Wakati ombisa, wakanyamula Davidi kuti ebeshe wabo. Wakasumikija eti, Ndawana munaDavidi, mwananhulumyana waJese, unhulume wokumoyo kwangu, uchata zwido zwangu zwose.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Muchizekululu choyu unhulume Mwali wabuza kunaIzilayeli uNchiji Jesu, sokubimbisa kukwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Asanu ezha, Joni wakaba abhaunula lubhabhatizo lwokushanduka kubanhu bose bomuIzilayeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Joni enda kunopeja unshingo uwe, wakati, “Imwi moyeyesela kuti ndimi ani? Anditoba iye. Ne, koga mushule lyangu kumuzha iye, wandisilokwelela kusupula ishangu jije.”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Banakwaina, bana bemhuli yaAbhulahamu, akale nabo pakati kwenu banotya Mwali, chilayijo choluchijo yechi chakatumijwa kwatili. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Nokuti yabo banogala muJelusalema nabatongi babo, nokuti abajakonziba kana kuwhisisisa inshamulo jabapolofeti, jinobalwa isabata nesabata, bakazhajikija yezwi nokuundasha. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kojoba basakawana undandu unokwelela kutongelwa kufa, bakakumbila kunaPilato kuti ebulayiwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Akale pabakazhajikija zwose zwakabakakwala nozuzwe, bakondeleja munti bakondajika mugumbu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Koga Mwali wakomusa mubafi, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />akale kwamazhuba manji wakazwitondejela kunabo baakava nabo kuGalili bezha kuJelusalema, bali ibo ngweno basumikiji babe kubanhu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Timumubuzila iNdebo iMbuya yakabimbiswa naMwali kumatategulu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Yezwi wazwizhajikija kunasu bana babo nokumusa Jesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">sezwilokwalwa akale muJimbo jabili, “Iwi umwananhulumyana wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">nasi ndakuzwala.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Akale sezwo ichokomende lyokuti wakomusa mubafi, kuti esibwilile akale kukubola, wakalebeleka neyi inzila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“Ndichakupa iwi makombolelo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">machena echokomende aDavidi.”<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Nokudalo unoti akale munolumwe Lwimbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“Imwi amutoolekelela uNchena wenu kuti ebole.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Koga Davidi, apeja kuta unshingo waMwali muchizekululu chiche, wakafa, akalajikwa namatate awe akale akabola, <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />koga iye wakamuswa naMwali, aajakabola. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Ngezwizibikane kwamuli, banakwaina, kuti nokuda kwoyu unhulume kulekejelwa kwoluchinyo kumupupulwa kwamuli, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />akale wose unodimbwa mwaali unosungunulwa muna icho chose chalukona kuti imwi musungunulwe nomulawu waMozesi. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Chenjelani, kuti yezwi zwinolebwa nabapolofeti zwisitikane kwamuli,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“Lingani, imwi munoheula, akale shamani, mupalale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">nokuti ndinota chitiko mumazhuba enu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">chitiko chamusinovumila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">kana umwe angomuzibisa imwi.”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Pabakabhuda pazhe, banhu bakabateteja kuti zwinhu yezwi ngana zwalebelekwa akale musabata linotobela. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Pakwakapela unshangano wesinagogi, baJuda banji nabamwe bakabadimbwa zwechokomende kubuJuda, bakatobela Paulu naBhanabhasi, bakalebeleka nabo bebasungwaja kuti bekwende mushe jaMwali.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />NeSabata lyakatobela bunji bwabeguta bakabungana bezha kowha iwhi lyaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Koga baJuda pabakabona bunji bwabanhu, bakazhala noluchibo, bakanyenyejela zwakabelebwa naPaulu akale bakontuka. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Paulu naBhanabhasi bakalebeleka besinalutyo beti, “Zwakaba zwikakwelela kuti iwhi lyaMwali lipupulwe kwamuli tangwa. Sezwo mwakalisundila kumbali, akale mukazwitonga mwoga imwi kuti amutokwelela bupenyu businopela, lingani isu tachebukila kunaBokuzhe.” <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Nokuti She wakatilaya isu, eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Ndakuta iwi kuti ube mwenje waBokuzhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">kuti iwi usenge luchijo kumapejelejo enyika.”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Pabakazwiwha yezwi Bokuzhe, bakashanta akale bakakuja iwhi lyaMwali, banji bakatambulwa mubupenyu businopela, bakadimbwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Iwhi lyaMwali lyakendila mbeli munyika yose. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Koga baJuda bakasungilija banhukaji banodimbwa banolemekejwa pamwempela nabanhulume banotungamila muguta kuti beyabise Paulu naBhanabhasi, akale bakabatatamila mubugalo bwabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ibo bakakuhumula ihuluba yokumakumbo abo pezhulu pabo, bakenda kuIkoniyumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Balayijwa bakazhala nolushanto akale noMpepo Nchena.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">KuAikoniyumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />KuAikoniyumu bakangwina musinagogi yabaJuda, bakapupula zwakata kuti igapo igulwana lyabaJuda nabaGiliki lidimbwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Koga baJuda basilodimbwa bakakunijila bokuzhe bakadila butulu mundangalilo jabo kuti bebabenganise mubwanakwaina. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Bakagala unshaji undefu belebeleka nemyoyo isina lutyo nezwaShe, Iye wakapa busumikiji kuwhi nechipiwo chiche, evumila zwitondejelo nezwichenamiso kuti zwitiwe namaboko abo. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Koga banhu beguta bakabe kaganukana, bamwe bakabeli kubhazu lyabaJuda, bamwe lyabapositoli. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Pabakakweja bose bokuzhe nabaJuda pamwempela nabatongi babo, kuti bebayabise akale kuti bebapubule namabwe, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />bakazwiwha yezwi bakatizhila ku Lisitila neDebhi, nokumakuta omuLaikoniya, nomunyika ilokomboloja, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />bakapupula iNdebo iMbuya kwakale.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuLisitila nomuDebhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Kwakaleko kuLisitila kwakaba kuli nonhulume usakabetubula kushingisa makumbo awe, eli igosha, esinotubula kukwenda, kuva ezwalwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Iye wakawhilila Paulu elebeleka, akale Paulu, wakontokoloja akale akabona kuti unakudimbwa kungonchilisa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />wakati newhi lipopezhulu, “Nyamuka ume namakumbo awo.” Iye wakashotoka akale akakwenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Luvute palwakabona zwatiwa naPaulu, lwakakongoloka mululimi lwabo lwechiLaikoniya beti, “Bamwali bezha pasi kwatili muchitojaniso chabanhu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bhanabhasi bakonti ndiZeusi, akale Paulu bakati ndiHemisi, nokuti ndiye wakaba eli undebeleki unkulwana. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Untebuji waZeusi, wakaba eli netempeli lilye mbeli kweguta, wakabuza inkabe jiloshongejwa namaluba kumashubo, eda kuta umpilo nabanhu.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Bapositoli Bhanabhasi naPaulu pabakazwiwha yezwi, bakajelula zwimbalo zwabo bakalabuka bengwina muluvute, bekongoloka, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Amwe banhu, munotilani yezwi? Isu tibanhu bo samwi, akale timumubuzila iNdebo iMbuya, kuti muchingunuke munezwi zwinhu zwisinanshingo kuna Mwali umpenyu wakabumba idenga nenyika, negungwa akale naizwo zwose zwimo mukati mwazwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Muzwizekululu zwapinda Mwali wakavumila kuti induji nenduji jikwende mujinzila jajo, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />koga aajakasiya kusina busumikiji, nokuti iye wakata zwibuya akale akamupa ivula kuva kudenga akale nemichelo mishaji yose yegole, iguncha mimwoyo yenu nokulya nolushanto.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Namawhi yaya bakatubula kulambija banhu kuti besipile untebulo kwabali. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Koga baJuda bakezha beva kuAntiyoki nokuAikoniyumu; bakabweta banhu, bakompubula Paulu, bakonkuluntila kuzhe kweguta, beyeyesela kuti wafa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Koga balayijwa pabakabungana paali wakamuka akangwina muguta, muchimuka wakenda naBhanabhasi kuDebhi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwilila kuAntiyoko muSiliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pabakapupula iNdebo iMbuya munelyo iguta akale kwaba nabalayijwa banji, ibo bakabwilila kuLisitila, nokuAikoniyumu akale nokuAntiyoki, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />besimisa myoyo yabalayijwa, bebasungwaja kuti bendile mbeli mukudimbwa, akale bebabuja kuti bengwine mubushe bwaMwali banokwelela kushangana namasheto. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pabakashala batungamili begubungano lyoga lyoga, bakanamata nokuzwiminya kulya, bakabapila kunaShe wabaluvumila mwaali. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Bakapinda nomuPisidiya, bakaswika kuPamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Pabakalebeleka iwhi muPega, bakenda pasi kuAtaliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />bava yoko bakakwenda nobwato benda kuAntiyoki, kunoba ikwo kwabakapiwa chipiwo chaMwali kuti bete unshingo ubakabazhajikija.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Pabakaswika, bakashoba igubungano pamwempela akale bakapupula zwose Mwali zwaakashinga nabo, nokuti wakazhula mikoba yokudimbwa kunaBokuzhe. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Bakagala unshaji undefu nabo balayijwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Igota lyokuJelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Bamwe banhulume bakezha beva kuJudiya, akale bakalayija banakwaina beti, “Kuzhe kwokuti mumhalajwe sengalilo yaMozesi, amutochijwa” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulu naBhanabhasi pabakanyenyejana nabo kasakasa, nokudalo kwakashalujwa Paulu naBhanabhasi nabamwe kuti bende kuJelusalema kubapositoli nabakulwana pezhulu penyaya yeyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Sezwo bakatumwa negubungano, bakapinda muFonisiya nomuSamaliya bepa lusumo nezwokushanduka kwaBokuzhe, inyaya yeyi yakashantisa bose banakwaina <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pabakaswika kuJelusalema, bakatambulwa negubungano nabapositoli akale nabakulwana, ndokuva babazibisa zwose Mwali zwaakata nabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Bamwe bavumili begapo lyabaFalisi, bakanyamuka bakati, “Zwilokwelela kuti tibamhalaje, akale tibalaye kuti belondote milawu yaMozesi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Bapositoli akale nabakulwana bakashangana kulingisisa inyaya yeyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Akale kwabana kukota kukulwana, Pita wakanyamuka akati kwabali, “Banakwaina, imwi mwoziba kuti mumazhuba otanga Mwali wakashala mukati mwedu, kuti Bokuzhe bewhe nondomo wangu, iNdebo iMbuya akale bedimbwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Mwali, iye unoziba zwimo mumwoyo, wakapa busumikiji kwabali, wakabapa uMpepo Nchena sezwaakatipa isu, <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />akale aajakasiyanisa pakati pedu naibo, koga wakashampuluja mimwoyo yabo nokudimbwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ngweno, nokudalo ini mukweja Mwali, nokubiga ijogwe mumichibha yabalayijwa lisakatubulwa namatate edu kana nasu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Koga todimbwa kuti neshe jaTezi Jesu, tichachijwa nenzila ilokwelana naibo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Akale bose bakabaka bungana bakawhilijila, akale bakawhilila Bhanabhasi naPaulu bebhaunula zwitondejelo nezwishamiso zwakatiwa naMwali eshingisa ibo kunaBokuzhe. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pabakapeja kulebeleka, Jemusi wakalebeleka eti, “Banakwaina ndiwhilileni, <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simiyoni watibuja kuti Mwali wakatanga chini kushanyila Bokuzhe, kuzwishalila banhu bezina lilye. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Akale mawhi abapolofeti anovumilana nezwi sezwakulokwalwa muwhalo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Mushule mwezwi, imi ndinoobuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ndinoobakulula bugalo bwaDavidi, bwakawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">imi ndinoobakulula iwo matongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ndinoamusilija akale,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />kuti bose banhu bompote Tezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">akale naBokuzhe bose banoshobwa nezina lyangu,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />unodalo Tezi, iye wakata kuti yezwi zwizibike kuvila ntolo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Nokudalo, kutonga kwangu ndinoti, tisinyaje Bokuzhe bamushandukila kuna Mwali, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />koga atibakwalileni ibo kuti belekeje kuswibhiswa nezwibezhwa, akale nobusangu akale, nozwasinwa akale nelopa. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kuvila chizekululu chokumatangilo, Mozesi wakaba elina banompupula mumakuta ose, nokuti iye unobalwa iSabata lyogalyoga mumasinagogo.<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukwalo kunaBokuzhe Bavumili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ngweno zwakaboneka zwilizwibuya kubapositoli akale nabakulwana, negubungano lyose, kushala banhulume mukati mwabo kuti bebatume kuAntiyoki naPaulu pamwempela naBhanabhasi.Bakatuma Judasi waluwhi Bhasabhasi, naSailasi, baluba banhulume bakulwana pakati pabanakwaina. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Bakakwala lukwalo lunotobela:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Isu bapositoli nabakulwana, kubanakwaina Bokuzhe kuAntiyoki akale kuSiliya nokuSilisiya, momuswa. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Patakawha kuti bamwe banhu bokunasu bakabemunyaja namawhi, bemujiija mundangalilo, kojoba tisakabatuma, <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />zwaboneka zwikakwelela kwatili, tikaswika pendangalilo imwempela, kushala banhulume akale tibatuma kwamuli nabanodikana bedu Bhanabhasi naPaulu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />ibo beli banhulume bakapila bupenyu bwabo nokuda kwezina lyaShe wedu Jesu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Nokudalo isu tatuma Judasi naSailasi, bali ibo bachamubuja yezwo zwinhu. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Nokudalo zwaboneka zwilizwibuya kuMpepo Nchena nokunasu kuti tisimutwigise untolo undemu kupinda zwilokwelela, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />kuti imwi muleke kulya zwilopilwa kuzwibezhwa, nelopa, kunezwakasinwa akale nobupombwe. Kana imwi mungosozwita yezwi, munobata zwibuyanana. Musale zwibuyanana.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Nezwo pabakakonekwa bakanyamuka kunda kwabakabatumwa, bakenda kuAntiyoki, akale pabakabunganisa igubungano pamwempela, bakabapa lukwalo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Pabakalubala, bakashantilwa nokusungwajwa yoko. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Judasi naSailasi, ibo bakabeli bapolofeti nokwabo, bakasungwaja banakwaina namawhi manji akale bebasimisa. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Bakati bagala unshaji belinabo, bakakonekana mulunyalalo nabanakwaina kuti bebwilile kunabo bakabatuma. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Akale zwakaboneka zwili zwibuya kunaSilasi kuti esale kwakale.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Koga Paulu naBhanabhasi bakendila mbeli beli muAntiyoki, belayija akale bebhaunula iwhi lyaShe belinabamwe banji bo.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu naBhanabhasi banopambukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Pakwakapinda mazhuba, Paulu wakati kuna Bhanabhasi, “Izha, ngatibwilile tishanyile banakwaina mumakuta ose mwatakapupula iwhi lyaShe, akale tibone kuti balichini.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Bhanabhasi wakada kuti etole Joni unowhi ndiMako. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Koga Paulu wakayeya zwilizwibuya kuti besiuntole nokuti wakabasiya pabakabeli kuPamfiliya akale aajakaba ata unshingo nabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kwakamuka kusowhanana, zwakatisa kuti bepambukane, Bhanabhasi wakatola Mako akenda naye bakangwina mubwato benda kuSaipulasi, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />asi Paulu wakashala Sailasi bakanyamuka, mushule mwokukumbililwa ishe jaMwali nabanakwaina. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Wakapinda muSiliya nomuSilisiya, esimisa makubungano.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti unonda naPaulu naSailasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Wakasikabo kuDebhi nokuLisita. Undayijwa wakabelimo yomo unowhi Timoti, mwananhulumyana wamai bechiJuda baluba umvumili, koga tate babe baluba unGiliki <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Wakabelebwa zwibuyanana nabanakwaina bomuLisita akale nabomuAikoniyumu. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulu wakada kuti Timoti ompelekeje, nokudalo wakontola akomhalaja nenyaya yabaJuda bakaba beli mubugalo yobo, nokuti bakaba beziba kuti tate babe unGiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pabakenda mulwendo lwabo bepinda mumakuta, bakabebanyeulila kuti belondote zwisungo zwakabatiwa nabapositoli nabakulwana bakaba beli kuJelusalema <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nokudalo makubungano akasimiswa mukudimbwa, akale akawanda izhuba nezhuba.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibono chaPaulu: Mutulowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bakapinda munyika yeFilijiya nomuGalatiya, nokuti bakaba bajibiswa noMpepo Nchena kuleba iwhi muEzhiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Pabakaswika pakalingana neMisiya, bakakweja kunda kuBhitiniya, koga uMpepo waJesu aujakabavumila, <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />nokudalo bakabapinda muMisiya, bakenda kuTulowasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Pakaboneka umbono kunaPaulu busiku, unhulume wokuMasedoniya elimile ombweta eti, “Izha kuMasedoniya utibhanche.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paakabona chibono, pakalepo takalonganyila kunda kuMasedoniya kuti tinobhaunula iNdebo iMbuya kwabali.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuFilipi: kuShanduka kwaLidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Takangwina mubwato tikakwenda kuva muTolowasi, tikananga kuSamotilasi akale nezhuba linotobela tikaswika kuNiyapolisi, <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />kuva yoko takaswika kuFilipi, lili ilyo iguta lyotanga kana ungwina mushango yeMasedoniya, akale ilinyika ili pasi pabaRoma. Takagala muneli iguta kwamazhuba, <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />nezhuba lyeSabata takenda kuzhe kweshubo kumbali kwolwizi, kwatakayeyela kuti kungaba nobugalo bonamatila, takagala pasi tikalebeleka nabanhukaji bakabaka bungana. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Umwe wakatiwha wakabeli unhukaji wakaba ewhi Lidiya, weguta lyeTiyatila, walutengesa ingubo jensulubele, akale enamata Mwali. She Mwali wakazhula moyo uwe kuti etambule zwakaba zwilebelekwa naPaulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Paakabhabhatizwa, nengumba iye yose, wakati kwekweteja eti, “Kana mwandibona kuti ndinobimbika kuna She, izhani mogala kungumba yangu.” Wakabhudilila kutibweta kuti tigale naye.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntolongo muFilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Patakaba tinda kubugalo bwokunamatila, takashangamijwa nonsichana unzike akale wakaba elinejimu lyokukandila, akale wakabebuzila beni babe ifuma inji nokuleba mbeli. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Iye wakatobela Paulu nasu, eshomeja eti, “Yaba banhulume zwishingi zwaMwali upezhuluzhulu, bamumubhaunulila inzila yoluchijo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Yezwi iye wakazwita kwamazhuba manji. Koga Paulu wakanyala, akachingunuka eti kunjimu, “Ndokulaya, muzina lyaJesu Kristo bhuda muna yiye.” Iwo wakabhuda muna iye nonshaji wakaleyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Koga matezi awe pabakabona kuti inzila yabo yokuwana ifuma yapalajwa, ibo bakabhata Paulu naSayilasi bakabakuluntila kubugalo bokushambajila, mbeli kwabatongi, <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Pabakababuza ibo mbeli kwabatongi bomulawo bakati, “Yaba banhulume ngabechiJuda, akale bamuzoza iguta lyedu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Ibo bamulebeleka bekuja ingalilo ikokuzhe kwomulawu, iyo isinokwelela kutiwa nasu maRoma” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Luvute lwakangwinila mukubalwisa, nokudalo batongi bomulawo bakabambula zwimbalo bakalaya kuti belobwe nemizato. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Pabakati babanabha kasakasa bakabaposela muntolongo, bakalaya undindi wejele kuti ebalondote. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Awana kulayiwa yoku, iye wakababiga muntolongo lyomukatikati akale akabasungilila makumbo kuzwitanda.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Kwaba pakati pobusiku Paulu naSilasi benamata nokukwimba jimbo kunaMwali, bamwe basungwa bakabakawhilila, <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />pakalepo kwakaba chidedemo chikulwana chenyika, zwakata kuti chimisikilo chentolongo chidengede, pakalepo matendele ejele ose akazhulika, maketani akabakabasunga bose akasungunuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Paakamuka undindi wejele wakabona mikoba yejele yakashama, wakabhisa igwabalaza lilye eda kuzwibulaya, eyeya kuti basungwa batizha. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Koga Paulu wakashomeja newhi lipo pezhulu eti, “Usuzwikubaje, tose tipo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Wakashomeja kuti zwimuniko zwitutumiswe, akangwina elabuka akale eluluma nolutyo akawila mbeli kwaPaulu naSailasi, <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />akababhisila pazhe akati, “Matate ini zwandingate kuti ndichijwe!”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ibo bakati, “Dimbwa muna She Jesu, unoochijwa, iwi nemhuli yiyo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ibo bakabhaunula iwhi lyaShe kwaali nokuna ibo bose bakaba beli mungumba yiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Iye wakabatola nonshaji wakaleyo wobusiku, akashambisa zwilonda zwabo, kova ebhabhatizwa pakalepo, nemhuli yiye yose. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Pakalepo wakabasenga kungumba yiye, akabiga zwokulya mbeli kwabo, iye wakashantilwa nemhuli yiye yose nokuti wakabadimbwa kunaMwali.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Pakwakeja, batongi bomulawo bakatuma mapolisa beti, “Lekejani banhulume yabo bende.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Undindi wejele wakabuja Paulu eti, “Batongi bomulawo batumila iwhi kuti musungunulwe, nokudalo ibhudani ngweno munde mulunyalalo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Koga Paulu wakati kwabali, “Ibo bakatiloba mbeli kwonhu wose, tisina undandu, isu tili banhulume akale tili banizi bechiRoma, bakatiposela muntolongo, ngweno bamuda kutibhisa zwesiswa? Mane! Ibo bomene ngebezhe bootibhisa.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Mapolisa bakabuja batongi bomulawo yaya mawhi, ibo bakatya pabakawha kuti tibanizi bechiRoma, <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />nokudalo bakezha bakokumbila lulekejelo kwabali. Bakababhisa bakabakumbila kuti bebhude muguta. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Nokudalo ibo pabakabhuda muntolongo, bakashanyila iLidiya, pabakati babona banakwaina, bakabasungwaja ndokuva benda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">MuTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pabakati bapinda muAmfipolisi nomuApoloniya, bakaswika kuTesalonika kwakaba kuli nesinagogi lyabaJuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulu wakangwina mukati sezwo wakaba uli ungalilo uwe, kwamaSabata matatu iye wakanyenyejana nabo zwivila muwhalo inchena, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />ebalungululila nokubabonesa kuti zwakaba zwikakwelela kuti Kristo esheteswe akale kuti emuke kubafi akale eti, “Yoyu Jesu wandimupupula kwamuli, Ndiye Kristo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Bamwe babo bakavumila kuba pamwempela naPaulu naSailasi, sezwakatiwa nabanji bechiGiliki akale nabanji banhukaji balozibikana. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Koga baJuda bakabanefupa, bakatola bamwe bazhuzha bezhoba, bakabunganija luvute, bakata imhelemhele muguta, akale bakazizinga ingumba yaJasoni, beshaka kubamisa mbeli kwabanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Pabakabashayiwa bakakulunta Jasoni nabamwe babanakwaina mbeli kwabatongi bweguta bekongoloka beti, “Yaba banhulume babuza kusogajikana inyika yose, bezhabo yokuno akale, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />kova Jasoni ebatambula, ibo bose bamulwanisa milawu yaSiza, beti kuna umwe She, Jesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Banhu nabatungamili beguta zwakabazoza kuwha yezwi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Pabakatola indipo yobutabilijo kuna Jasoni nokuna bamwe bose, bakabalekeja bakenda.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuBheliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Banakwaina pakalepo nobusiku bakatumila Paulu naSailasi kuBheliya, pabakaswika bakangwina musinagogi lyabaJuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ngweno yaba baJuda bakabakalulama kupinda yabo bokuTesalonika, nokuti bakalitambula iwhi nokulidisisisa, belingisisa makwalo machena mazhuba ose kubona kuti yezwi zwinhu ichokomende na. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Banji babo bakadimbwa nabanji banhulume nabanhukaji bechiGiliki banokujwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Koga baJuda bokuTesalonika pabakawha kuti iwhi lyaMwali lyakabhaunulwa naPaulu kuBheliya neebo, ibo bakezha kwakale neebo, bakakunijila banhu kuti bebamukile. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Pakalepo banakwaina bakatumila Paulu munzila mulwendo lwokugungwa, asi Sailasi naTimoti bakasala mwakalemo. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Yabo bakapelekeja Paulu bakonswincha kuAtenisi, akale balayiwa kuti bebuje Sailasi naTimoti kuti bezhe kwaali, nokukambijisa, bakanyamuka bakenda.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">MuAtenisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ngweno Paulu wakabamilila muAtenisi, umpepo uwe wakanyetejwa nokubona iguta lilizhele zwibezhwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nokudalo iye wakanyenyejana nabaJuda akale nabamwe bakabenamata nabo musinagogi akale mubugalo bokushambajila naibo bose bakabewanikwa mwakale mazhuba ose. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Bamwe bo bazinandayijo bamakapo anowhi baEpikuliyani nabaSitoyiki bakashangana naye. Bamwe bakati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">“Iye unozwita unzibi umutini na?” Bamwe bakati, “Unanga umbhaunuli wabamwali banovakule,” nokuti wakaba ebhaunula Jesu nezwokumuka kubafi. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Bakontola iye, bakonsenga kuAliyopagasi, beti, “Timuda kuziba kuti indayijo yeyi impya yaumupupula ngiyeni? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Nokuti iwi umubuza zwisinowhisisika munzebe jedu, nokudalo tinodabo kuziba kuti yezwi zwinolebani.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Ngweno bose baAteniya nabavakule bakaba begala imo, unshaji wabo wose baluunshingisa kuleba kana kuwha zwinhu zwipya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Nokudalo, Paulu elimile pakati peAliyopagasi, wakati, “Banhu bomuAteniya, ndabona kuti munzila jose mubanhu banoda zwobumwali. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Nokuti pandabekwenda, ndilingisisa zwinhu zwamunonamata, ndawana akale idebulilo lilokwalwa kuti, ‘Kunamwali usinozibwa.’ Yoyo wamunonamata sousinozibwa, ndiye wandimupupula kunamwi. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Mwali wakabumba inyika naizwo zwose zwimomukati, eliShe wedenga nenyika, aatogala muzwibakwa zwakabakwa nabanhu, <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />kana kuti unotilwa zwinhu namaboko abanhu, sofana iye unoshayiwa chinhu, iye ndiye unopa bose banhu bupenyu nompepo wokufhema akale naizwo zwose. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Akale wakabumba induji jose kuti lube luji lumwempela lwabanhu, kuti begale pabugalo bwose bwopenyika, akababambanyila mishaji nemigano yobugalo bwabo, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />kuti beshake Mwali pelina chibimbo chokuti banowha zwiti bonshake akale bongwane. Kojoba alo iye aaiko kule noumwe noumwe wedu, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />nokuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Muna Iye tibapenyu, tokwendenda akale tolalama.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Zwinanga sezwakalebwa nabamwe benu banokuma beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Naswibo bo tinzwalo yiye.<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Sezwo tili bana baMwali, atitokwelela kuyeya kuti Mwali unanga sezwibumbwa zwegolide kana zwesiliva, kana zwebwe, zwinobumbwa namaboko nendangalilo jabanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Unshaji wokusoziba Mwali wakapinda, koga ngweno Iye unolaya banhu bose pabugalo bwose kuti beshanduke, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />nokuti ulobiga izhuba lyokutonga inyika yose nelyobululami nesimba lyonhu waakaponcha akale pana yezwi wakapa chibimbiso kunhu wose nokuumusa kubafi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Pabakawha nezwokumuka kwabakafa bamwe bakonseka, koga bamwe bakati, “Toda kukuwha uleba yezwi akale umwe unshaji.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Pakalepo Paulu wakabhuda mukati mwabo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Koga bamwe banhulume bakadimbwa bakontobela, mukati mwabo pakabeli naDionisiyasi uAleopagaiti, akale nonhukaji unowhi Damalisi nabamwe baakaba eli nabo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">MuKolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Mushule mwezwo wakabhuda muAtenisi akenda kuKolinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Wakawana unJuda unowhi Akwila, chizwalwa chokuPontasi, echinoswika eva kuItali, nonkaji uwe unowhi Pulisila, nokuti Kilaudiyasi wakaba alayila baJuda bose kuti bebhude muRoma. Iye wakenda kunobabona, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />nokuti bakaba beta unshingo umwempela naiye, wakagala nabo, akale bakashinga bose nokuti bose bakaba belibafhumi bamatente. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Wakanyenyejana nabo nezhuba lyeSabata lyogalyoga musinagogi, ekweja kubabweta baJuda nabaGiliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Pakaswika Timoti naSailasi beva kuMasedoniya, Paulu wakaba ekabhatikana nokubhaunula, nokusumikija kubaJuda kuti Kristo ndiye Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Asi pabakonshunda nokuntuka, iye wakakuhumula zwimbalo zwizwe, akati kwabali, “Ilopa lyenu libe pamisholo yenu! Imi andina undandu. Kuvila nasi ndimunda kunaBokuzhe.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Wakabhuda yopo, akenda kungumba yonhulume unowhi Taitasi Jusitasi, unonamata Mwali, ingumba yiye yakabakabakijana nesinagogi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipusi, unkulwana wesinagogi, wakadimbwa munaShe pamwempela nemhuli yiye yose, nabanji baKolinte bakawha Paulu bakadimbwa bakabhabhatizwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Bumwe busiku muchibono, She wakati kuna Paulu, “Usitye, koga lebeleka akale usinyalale, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />nokuti ndinanawi, akale apana unhu uchakuzizinga nokukulwajisa, nokuti ndinabanhu banji muneli iguta.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Iye wakagala igole lina myeji mishanu nomwempela, elayija iwhi lyaMwali mukati mwabo.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Kwakati Galiyo eli untongi weAkeya, baJuda bakabhatana kumukila Paulu, bakombuza mbeli kwegota <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />beti, “Yoyu unhulume, umukwekweteja banhu kuti benamate Mwali nenzila isimo mumulawo!” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulu paakada kushamula undomo uwe, Galiyo wakati kubaJuda, “Ngana ilinyaya yokuchinya, kana yondandu umbi ndaluba nendangalilo yokumuwhilila, amwe baJuda, <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />koga nokuti yeyi inyaya yemibhuzo yendebo akale namazina nemilawo yenu, zwiboneleni imwi nokwenu, imi ndalamba kuba untongi wezwi zwinhu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Wakava abatatamila pegota lyobutongi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ibo bose bakabhata Sositenesi, untongi wesinagogi, bakondoba mbeli kwegota. Koga Galiyo aajakaba neni nazwo yezwi.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwilila kuAntiyoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Mushule mwezwi Paulu wakagala mazhuba manji, ndipo paakakonekana nabanakwaina akangwina mubwato enda kuSiliya, eli naPulisila naAkwila. Eli kuKenkiliya wakagusa masusu, nokuti wakata ikowhe. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Pabakati baswika kuEfesu, wakasiyana nabamwe babe yopo, kova iye engwina musinagogi akanyenyejana nabaJuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Pabakonkumbila kuti egale nabo kwonshaji undefu, iye wakalamba, <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />koga paakabakoneka iye wakati, “Imi ndinoobuya kwamuli, kana kuli kuda kwaMwali,” akangwina mubwato ebhuda muEfesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Paakaswika kuKesaliya, wakenda kunomusa igubungano, akale akenda kuAntiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Agala unshaji kwakaleko, iye wakanyamuka akenda kubugalo bulosiyanasiyana mushango IyeGalatiya neFilijiya esimisa balayijwa bose.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolosi muEfeso nomuKolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ngweno unJuda unowhi Apolosi, chizwalwa chokuAlekizandiliya wakezha kuEfesu. Iye wakaba eli unhulume unachipo chokulebeleka, noluzibo lwamakwalo machena, elinoluzibo lwewhalo inchena. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Iye wakaba akalayijwa munzila jaShe akale episikana mumpepo, iye wakabelebeleka akale elayija nechokomende nezwaJesu, kojoba wakaba eziba lubhabhatizo lwaJoni chete. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Wakatanga kulebeleka esinotya musinagogi, koga Pulisila naAkwila bakonwha iye, bakontola, bakombhaunulila inzila yaMwali edondomeka. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Paakada kutaluka enda kuAkeya, banakwaina bakonsungwaja, akale bakakwalila balayijwa kuti bontambule. Paakaswika, wakabhancha kasa neshe jaMwali kunabo bakabadimbwa, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />nokuti iye wakanyenyejana nabaJuda elineshungu pebunga lyabanhu, etondejela mumakwalo machena kuti Kristo ndiye Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulu MuEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolosi echikuKolinte, Paulu wakapinda zhezhulu kwenyika akaswika kuEfesu. Yoko wakawana bamwe balayijwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Wakati kwabali, “Mwakatambula uMpepo uNchena na pamwakadimbwa?” Ibo ndikokuti, “Pe, atijanhu tawha kuti kuna uMpepo uNchena.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Iye wakati, “Imwi mwakatambula umbhabhatizo wakata chini?” Ibo bakati, “Mumbhabhatizo waJoni.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulu akati, “Joni wakabhabhatiza nombhabhatizo wokushanduka, ebuja banhu kuti bedimbwe kunooyo uchoozha mushule mumwe, yoyo eliJesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Pabakawha yezwi bakabhabhatizwa muzina lyaShe Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paulu paakati abiga maboko awe pezhulu pabo, uMpepo Nchena wakabhulukila pabali, ibo bakalebeleka mundimi akale bakapolofita <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ibo bose bakabeli igumi nababili. <verse eid="ACT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Iye wakangwina musinagogi akale kwemyeji mitatu wakalebeleka esina lutyo, enyenyejana akale ebhaunula zwinyolonyolo nezwobushe bwaMwali, <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />koga bamwe bakaba beli nobundulundulu akale besinodimbwa, belebeleka bubi nozweNzila mbeli kwegubungano, iye wakabhuda mwabali akatola balayijwa, akale mazhuba ose wakaba ebalayija mungumbehulu yaTailanusi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Yezwi zwakandila mbeli kwamakole mabili, zwokuti bose bagali bomuEzhiya bakaliwha iwhi lyaShe, bose baJuda nabaGiliki. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mwali wakata zwishamiso zwikulwana namaboko aPaulu, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />zwokuti tutaulu kana inhako zwaakabeshingisa pambili uwe zwakazwisengwa kubalwaji, malwaji epela nemipepo mibi ibhuda mwabali. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Bamwe bakabekwendenda bebhisa mipepo mibi bechiJuda, bakakweja kushingisa izina lyaShe Jesu kunabo bana mipepo mibi, beti “Ndomulayila imwi muzina lyaJesu umupupulwa naPaulu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Bana banhulumyana bashanu banababili bontebuji unkulwana wechiJuda unowhi Sikeva ndibo bakaba bezwita yezwi. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Koga umpepo umbi wakabashandula ibo, “Jesu ndinounziba, naPaulu ndonziba, koga iwi ndiwi aani?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Unhulume wakaba eli nompepo umbi wakabashotokela, wakabakoma akabazunda bose, zwokuti bakabhuda muneyo ingumba bakatizha beli chinkuna akale balwajiswa. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Yezwi zwakazibwa nabaJuda nabaGiliki nabagali bose bomuEfesu, nolutyo lukaba munaibo bose, nokudalo izina lyaShe Jesu lyakakujwa zwikulwana kasa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Banji babo nabakabadimbwa pakalepo bakezha belebulula akale nokubhisila pachena zwito zwabo. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Nabanji babo baluta zwamasalamusi, bakabuza iwhalo jabo pamwempela jikapiswa mbeli kwabo bose, yakalabwa imali yajo jose ikaswika zwiulu makumi mashanu esiliva. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Nokudalo iwhi lyaTezi lyakakubuka akale likazunda zwinamasimba makulwana.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ibhilimanyondo muEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Mushule mwezwi zwitiko, Paulu wakazwimisila mumpepo uwe kupinda kuMasedoniya nomuAkeya enda kuJelusalema eti, “Mushule mokuswika kwangu yoko, imi ndokwelela kunobona iRoma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Mushule mwokutuma Timoti naElasitusi babhanchi babe babili, kuMasedoniya, iye emene wakagala muEzhiya kwonshaji.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Noyo unshaji kwakamuka iditi igulwana pezhulu peNzila yeyo. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Nokuti unhulume waluwhi Demetriyasi, umfhuli wesiliva wakabebumba zwibumbwa zwaAtemisi, zwakaba zwibuza mishingo isimishoma kubafhuli. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Yaba wakababuza pamwempela, nabanhulume yaba baluta unshingo umwempela akati, “Matate mwoziba kuti ifuma yedu yabeva munshingo yoyu. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mubweni akale muwhile yezwi kuti akutoba kuEfesu chete, koga iEzhiya yose, yoyu Paulu wabweta akale akashandula banhu banji, eti zwimwali zwinotiwa namaboko abatoba Mwali. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Kuchaba negubanji kunshingo wedu unoolingilwa pasi, netempeli lyaMwali wedu unkulugulu, chimwalikaji Atemisi, chinooba chisichinoleba chinhu, akale iye angabhiswa mububuya bubwe, iye unonamatwa neEzhiya nepasi lyose.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Pabakawha yezwi bakanyema kasakasa bakashomeja beti, “Unkulugulu Atemisi waba Efesu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Nokudalo iguta lyakazhala inyonganyonga akale ibo bakalabuka bose pamwempela bengwina mungumba yemizano, bekulunta Gayasi naAlisitakasi, baMasedoniya bakabekwenda naPaulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulu wakada kungwina pakati poluvute, koga balayijwa bakondambija, <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />nabamwe bakulwana beshango yeEzhiya bakababeli bakwaina babe, bakatumila kwaali akale bakombweta kuti eleke kungwina mubugalo bwemizano. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Bamwe bakakongoloka chimwe chinhu, bamwe chimwe, nokuti igubungano lyakaba inyonganyonga, bunji bwabo abajakaziba kuti zwababuza pamwempela ini. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Bamwe boluvute bakasungilija Alekizanda, wakatungamijwa nabaJuda. Alekizanda wakamilija luboko eda kuti elebeleke etabilija. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Koga pabakaziba kuti unJuda, ibo bose bakakongoloka, kwonshaji ungaba maawa mabili, newhi limwempela beti, “Unkulwana Atemisi weEfeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Unkwali weguta paakanyalaja luvute wakati, “Banakwaina bomuEfeso, ndiyani unhu yomuno usinoziba kuti iguta lyeEfeso ndilyo undondoti wetempeli lyaAtemisi unkulwana webwe lyechitondejelo lyakawa liva kudenga? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Sezwazwinoboneka ngweno kuti yezwi zwinhu zwisinonyenyejekwa, imwi mokwelela kuti munyalale akale musite zwinhu zwokambija <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Sezwo imwi mwabuza banhulume yaba yopano, ibo basata undandu wokuzanisa kana kutuka mwalikaji. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Kana Demetriyasi nabafhuli bananaye belina chililijiko kana nani, makota obeteka alozhulwa, akale pana batongi, ngebebuze ibo milandu ilonangana nomwe noumwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Koga kana imwi mupyanga zwimwe zwinopinda yezwi, zwinopejwa nenzila yamazhuba ose mugota. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Nokuti isu timo mugubaji lyokupiwa undandu webhilimanyondo nasi, sezwo pesina zwatingalulamisa neli igwilakwila.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Paakati iye alebeleka yezwi, iye wakalimwayisa igubungano.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">KuMasedoniya nokuAkeyiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Palyakapela Igwilakwila, Paulu wakashoba balayijwa, akabasungwaja nokubakoneka akanyamuka enda kuMasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Paakati apinda munoobu bugalo akale akabakutaija, akenda kuGilisi. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Wakagala kwemyeji mitatu, yoko baJuda bakalangana kunkubaja alobongwina mubwato, kuti ende kuSiliya, iye akazwimisila kubwilila epinda muMasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopata wokuBheliya, mwananhulumyana waPilusi ndiye wakompelekeja, nabokuTesalonika naAlisitakasi naSekundasi, naGayusi wokuDebhe, naTimoti, nabokuEzhiya, Tayikikusi naTilofimasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Yaba bakatungamila bakanotimilila kuTulowasi, <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />koga takakwenda nobwato tibhuda muFilipu mushule mwamazhuba echinkwa chisina umfufumuso, mumazhuba mashanu takaswika kwabali kuTulowasi, kwatakagala mazhuba mashanu ana mabili.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwendo lwaPaulu lwokupejeleja kuTulowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Nezhuba lyotanga lyemviki, patakashangana pamwempela komedula chinkwa, Paulu wakalebeleka nabo, eli nendangalilo yokunyamuka muchimuka, wakalebhesa iNdebo yiye mane kukaswika pakati pobusiku. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Pakaba peli nezwimuniko zwinji mungumba yopezhulu mwatakabakashanganila. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Unzhuzha izina lilye waluwhi Yutikasi wakaba eligele pewindo. Iye wakabhatwa nehope, Paulu paakandila mbeli elebeleka, ihope jakwonzunda, akambwelela pasi eva mungumba yechitatu yopezhulu, akanyamulwa afa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Koga Paulu wakadelela, akakotama pezhulu pape, akomungutila akati, “Musitenhuuke, uchimpenyu yoyu.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Paulu wakatanha, akamedula chinkwa akalya, kova elebeleka nabo kwonshaji undefu, kuswikila muchimuka ndipo paakakwenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Bakontola unzhuzha eliumpenyu, bakanyalajika kasakasa.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuva kuTulowasi kunda kuMiletasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Koga takenda mbeli kubwato, tikakwenda tinda kuAsosi, takananga kunogadisa Paulu mubwato, nokuti iye wakaba eli nendangalilo jokukwenda nenzila yomudunhu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Paakashangana nasu kuAsosi, isu takontola nobwato tikaswika kuMitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Takakwenda nobwato nezhuba linotobela tikaswika kubugalo bulolingana neKiyosi, izhuba linotobela takaswika kuSamosi, muchimuka ndipo patakaswika kuMiletusi. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Nokuti, Paulu wakazwimisila kupindila nobwato kuEfesu, kutila kuti esitole unshaji muEzhiya, nokuti wakaba eda kukambijisa kuti ebe kuJelusalema, kana zwitikana, nezhuba lyePentekositi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indebo yokukoneka yaPaulu kubakulwana begubungano bokuEfesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Eli ku Miletusi wakatumija iwhi kuti bakulwana begubungano kuEfesu bezhe kwaali. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Pabakaswika wakati kwabali, “Imwi momene mwoziba kuti ndakagala chini mukati mwenu, unshaji wose kuvila izhuba lyotanga lyandakatoba negumbo lyangu muEzhiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Ndishingila She nokuzwininipisa, ndili nemishoji nokukwejwa kwakandizhila pezhulu pokuchetwa nabaJuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Kuti andijakabwilila mushule mukuzibisa imwi zwose zwalumubhancha, kana kumulayija pazhele banhu akale nomujingumba. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ndimusumikija kunaibo bose baJuda nabaGiliki, kuti beshandukile kuna Mwali akale nokudimbwa kuna Tezi wedu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Bonani ngweno, ndikumunda kuJelusalema, ndakasungwa mumpepo, ndisinoziba kuti ini zwichatikana kwandili kwakalekuya; <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />koga uMpepo Nchena umusumikija kwandili muguta neguta kuti ijele nokusheteswa kulondimilila. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Imi anditokuja bupenyu bwangu ndibupa bukulwana bwopezhulu kwandili, asi kuti nditubule kuta zwandinokwelela munshingo wandakatambula kuna She Jesu, wokusumikija iNdebo iMbuya yechipiwo chaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Ngweno lingani ndinoziba kuti mose imwi bandaba ndingwinuka ndibhaunula Bushe, amuchinofa mwachibona chiso changu akale. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Nokudalo, ndosumikija kwamuli nasi yelino izhuba kuti andina undandu welopa lyaani nani wenu, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />nokuti andijakabwilila mushule kumubuja imwi chose chilayo chaMwali. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Zwichenjeleleni imwi, nokudanga lyose, lyamwakapiwa noMpepo uNchena kuti mube batondeji, mulondote igubungano lyaMwali lyaakawana nelopa lyomwananhulumyana uwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndoziba kuti pandichakwenda, mashambo anotyisa anooswika mukati mwenu esinolekeja idanga, <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />akale kuva mukati mwenu munoobhutunuka banhu bachalebeleka zwinhu zwinopesanisa, zwichanyungumula balayijwa kuti bebatobele. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nokudalo, chenjelani, mukumbulukwa kuti kwamakole matatu, andijakalekeja kumuchenjeja busiku kana masikati, umwe noumwe wenu ndili nemishoji.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Ngweno ndomupila kunaMwali, akale nokuwhi lyechipiwo chiche, linotubula kumubaka imwi akale kupiwa ishabo kunabo bakacheneswa. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Imi andijakachiba isiliva kana igolide kana zwimbalo zwomwe unhu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Imwi momene mwoziba kuti yaya maboko akandishingila munaizo zwose zwandakaba ndishaka, nokushingila yabo bakaba beli nami. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Munaizwo yezwi zwinhu ndakatondejela kuti nokushinga umwe unobhancha balodemuka, mukumbulukwa mawhi aShe Jesu, mwaakalebeleka eti, ‘Kulokombolelwa kasa kupa kunakutambula.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paakati alebeleka alo, iye wakafhigama akanamata nabo bose. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Ibo bose bakalila, bakomfufuzhila Paulu akale bakomyonta, <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />zwakababhaya, kasa namawhi aakalebeleka, eti abachinochibona chiso chiche akale. Bakava bompelekeja kubwato bubwe.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulu unonda kuJelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Akale takapambukana nabo, takakwenda mubwato, tikalingisa twisi tikanoswika kuKosi, muchimuka takaswika kuRodesi kuva yopo takenda kuPatala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Patakawana bwato bunodubula bunda kuFonisiya, takangwina mwakale tikakwenda. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Patakaba panoboneka iSayipulasi, takayisiya kuchesho, tikalingisa kuSiliya, tikanoma kuTayi, nokuti yopa bwato bwakaba budeluja zwibya. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Patakashangana nabalayijwa, takagala nabo mazhuba mashanu ana mabili. Betungamililwa noMpepo ibo bakabuja Paulu kuti esinde kuJelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Paakati apela mazhuba edu, takendila mbeli nolwendo wedu, ibo bose, nabakaji nabana bakatipelekeja bakatiswincha kuzhe kweguta, takafhigama pebhazu lyegungwa tinamata kova tikonekana umwe noumwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Pakalepo takangwina mubwato, ibo bakabwilila kumisha yabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Patakati tapeja lwendo lwomugungwa kuva kuTayi, takaswika kuTolemayisi, takamusa banakwaina tikagala nabo kwezhuba limwempela. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Muchimuka takanyamuka tikanoswika kuKesaliya, kwatakangwina mungumba yaFilipu umvangeli, wakaba eli umwe wabashanu banababili tikagala naye. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Iye wakaba eli nabana banhukajana bana, bakabepolofita. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Tichigele kwamazhuba, umpolofeti unowhi Agabhasi waluva kuJudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Wakezha kwatili, akatola ibhanti lyaPaulu akazwisunga iye nokukwe makumbo namaboko, kova eti, “Unodalo uMpepo uNchena unoti: BaJuda bokuJelusalema bachasunga mweni webhanti yeli akale bompile kunaBokuzhe.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Patakazwiwha yezwi, isu pamwempela nabanhu bopakalepo takombweta iye kuti esinde kuJelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Pakalepo Paulu wakadabila eti, “Mumutani na, mulila ali mulwajisa moyo wangu? Imi ndilozwimisila kuti ndisungwe kana kufa zwako kuJelusalema, pezhulu pezina lyaTezi Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Paakalamba kukombelelwa nasu, takawhilijila tikati, “Chido chaTezi ngechitiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Kwakati kwapinda mazhuba yaya, isu takazwibambanyila tikenda kuJelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Bamwe babalayijwa banova kuKesaliya bakenda nasu, betisenga kungumba yaMunasoni wokuSaipulasi, undayijwa wantolo, watalunogala naye.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unoshanyila Jemusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Patakati taswika muJelusalema, banakwaina bakatitambula nolushanto. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Muchimuka, Paulu wakenda nasu kunaJemusi, nabakulwana bakaba belipo. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Patakapeja kumusana nabo, wakalondejela chimwe nechimwe chezwinhu zwakatiwa naMwali mukati mwaBokuzhe nokushinga kukwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Pabakazwiwha yezwi, ibo bakakuja Mwali. Bakati kwaali, “Iwi ubweni mwanakwaina, kuti zwiulu zwinji chini zwabanovumila mukati mwabaJuda, ibo bose balosungwalila zwomulawu, <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />akale ibo balobujwa nezwizwo iwi kuti umubalayija bose bechiJuda bagele naBokuzhe kuti belashe Mozesi, ubabuja ibo kuti besimhalaje bana babo kana kutobela ungalilo yoyo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Tota chini ngweno? Ibo bose bachawha kuti iwi wezha. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Nokudalo ita zwatinokubuja. Isu tina banhulume bana balosungwa nekowhe, <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />tola banhulume yaba uzwichenese pamwempela nabo, ubalipile indipo yabo, kutila kuti beguswe misholo yabo. Yezwi zwinota kuti bose bebone kuti yezwi zwabakabujwa nezwizwo azwitoba izwo, koga iwi unosokwenda ulondota mulawo. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Kana zwili zwaBokuzhe bakadimbwa, isu tatumija lukwalo luna untongo wedu kuti belekeje kulya zwapilwa kuzwibezhwa akale nelopa nezwasinwa akale nobupomboli.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Pakalepo Paulu wakatola banhulume yabo, muchimuka iye wakazwichenesa pamwempela nabo, ndipo pabakangwina mutempeli, benopa chizibiso chokuti mazhuba okuzwichenesa anozhajikijwa lini akale nompilo womwe nomwe.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unosungwa muTempeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Alobopela mazhuba mashanu ana mabili, baJuda bokuEzhiya, bakombona eli mutempeli, bakakunijila luvute lwose, ndokuva bombhata iye, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />beshomeja beti, “Banhu bomuIzilayeli, bhanchani! Yoyu ndiye unhulume umulayija banhu kwosekwose zwisinokwendelana nabanhu, nomulawu akale nobugalo bwedu yobuno, pezhulu pezwi iye wakangwinisa baGiliki mutempeli, nokudalo wakaswibhisa bugalo buchena yobu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Bakadalo nokuti ibo bakababona Tolofinasi wokuEfesu elinaye muguta, akale bakayeyela kuti Paulu wakongwinisa mutempeli.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Pakalepo iguta lyose lyakanyandulwa, banhu bakalabuka pamwempela, bakombhata Paulu bakonkulunta, iye bombhisa mutempeli, pakalepo mashubo akakonywa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Bechinokweja kuumbulaya iye, iwhi lyakaswika kuntungamili wegapo lyabalwi kuti yose iJelusalema yaba inyonganyonga. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Iye pakalepo wakatola balwi nabatungamili bamazana, bakalabuka benda kwaabali, pabakabona untungamili nabalwi, bakalekeja kundoba Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Pakalepo untungamili wabalwi wakenda kwaali akonsunga iye kova elayila, kuti esungwe namaketani mabili. Wakombhuza kuti iye ndiyani akale kuti wakaba atani. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Bamwe mudupwa bakaba bekongoloka zwimwe zwinhu, bamwe zwimwe bo, sezwo aajakawana ichokomende nenyonganyonga, iye wakalaya kuti ebuzwe mungumba yabalwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paakaswika pamitambiliko bakonyamula nokuti idupwa lyakabanyema nolunya, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />luvute lwabanhu lwakatobela lushomeja luti, “Ngebulayiwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unozwilwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Paulu alobongwiniswa mungumba yabalwi, iye wakati kuntungamili wabalwi, “Ndimukumbila kulebeleka chimwe chinhu kwauli?” .Iye akati, “Unoziba chiGiliki na? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Autoba iwi uNjipiti yondya wakada kusungilija banhu ngwenongweno kuti bepanduke akale akatungamila bapanduki bakabulaya banhu zwiulu zwina, mugwegulu!”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulu wakashandula eti, “Imi ndinJuda unova kuTasusi muSilisiya, ungali weguta lisidukutuku, ndimukumbila, undivumile ndilebeleke kubanhu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Paakompa imvumo, Paulu elimile pontobelo, wakanyamula luboko kubanhu, kwakaba nokunyalala kukulwana, wakalebeleka kwabali mululimi lwechiHebhelu.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Banakwaina namatate, iwhani kuzwilwila kwangu kwandimuta mbeli kwenu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pabakawha kuti umulebeleka nabo mululimi lwechiHebhelu, bakawhilijila kasa. Iye wakati,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Imi ndinJuda, ndakazwalilwa kuTasusi muSilisiya, koga ndakakubusilwa munelino iguta mudako lyaGamaliyeli, ndikalayijwa munzila indemu inosimatija mulawo wamatate edu, ndakasungwalila Mwali sezwamuli mose nezhuba lyanasi. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Imi ndakayangatisa banhu beNzila yeyi kuswikila kulufu, ndibasunga akale ndibasenga muntolongo bose banhulume nabanhukaji, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />untebuji unkulwana negota lyose lyabakulwana lingapa busumikiji nozwo. Kuva kunaibo ndakawana iwhalo jokunda kubanakwaina, akale imi ndakatola lwendo lwokunda kuDamasikasi kunotola yabo, bakabeli kwakale ndibabuza bakasungwa kuJelusalema kuti bojiijwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unolebeleka nokushanduka kukwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Mishingo 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Ndili mulwendo lwangu akale ndabapelyo neDamasikasi, masikati makulwana, kwakandiswikila kupenya kukulwana kwakabeva kudenga. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ndakawila pasi ndikawha iwhi liti kwandili, ‘Saulu, Saulu! Ini undiyabisa Imi?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Ndakashandula nditi, ‘Ndiwi ani, Tezi?’ Iye wakati kwandili, ‘Ndimi Jesu wokuNazaleta, waukumujiija.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Ngweno yabo bakabeli nami bakabona lupenyo koga abajakawha iwhi lyoyo wakaba elebeleka kwandili. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Imi ndakati, ‘Nditeni biya Tezi?’ Tezi wakati kwandili, ‘Nyamuka, unde muDamasikasi, kwakaleko unonobujwa zwose zwaulomisilwa kuti ute.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ndisichinobona pezhulu pokupenya kwakatikana, imi ndakabhatwa luboko nabo bandakaba ndilinabo tikanongwina muDamasikasi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Umwe unowhi Ananiyasi, unhulume ulodimbwa zwechokomende mumulawo, elebelekwa nezwizwe zwibuyanana nabaJuda bose bakaba begala yomo, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />wakezha kwandili akama pelyo nami akati kwandili, ‘Mwanakwaina Saulu, bona!’ Pakalepo ndakava ndabona, naiye ndikombona. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Wakati iye, ‘Mwali wamatategulu edu wakakumisila kuti iwi uzibe kuda kukwe, kuti umbone Iye wakalulama akale uwhe iwhi linova mundomo mumwe, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />nokuti iwi unoba unsumikiji uwe kubanhu bose wezwose zwawakabona nokuwha. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nokudalo, uchilomililani? Nyamuka ubhabhatizwe luchinyo lulo lushambiswe, ushoba izina lilye.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unoshobwa kunopupulila Bokuzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Pandakati ndabuya kuJelusalema, ndili mukunamata ndili muTempeli, ndakaba sonhu umulota, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />ndikombona eti kwandili, ‘Kambijisa ubhude muJelusalema, nokuti abatobutambula busumikiji bubo pezhulu pangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Imi ndakati, ‘Tezi, ibo bomene banoziba kuti ndakababiga muntolongo ndikaloba mumasinagogo yabo baludimbwa kunamwi. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Akale ilopa lyaSitivini unsumikiji wuwo, palyakakutulwa, namibo ndakaba ndilimile pelyo ndivumila, akale ndakalondota zwimbalo zwayabo bakombulaya.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Wakati kwandili, ‘Nyamuka, ukwende nokuti Imi ndichakutuma kule kunaBokuzhe.’” <verse eid="ACT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Bakonwhilila kuswikilaa kunelyo iwhi, bakanyamuka benyamula mawhi abo beti, “Ngebhiswe munyika unhu wakadai! Aatokwelela kuba umpenyu!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Belimukushomeja nokuzyiusa zwimbalo zwabo akale beposa lukuluba mumpepo, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />untungamili wabalwi wakalaya kuti iye ebuzwe mungumba yabalwi, akale akalaya kuti eshenengulwe nokulobwa, kuti kuzibikane kuti ini zwimutisa kuti kube nezhoba. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Koga pabakati bonsunga neminchili, Paulu wakati kuntungamili wabalwi izana wakaba elimile pelyo naye, “Zwimo mumulawo na kuti munabhe unizi weRoma akale esina undandu!”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Paakawha yezwi, untungamili wezana lyabalwi, wakenda kuntongi akati kwaali, “Walebotani ? Yoyu unhulume unizi weRoma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Nokudalo untongi wakenda akati kwaali, “Ndibuje, unizi womuRoma na!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Iye wakati, “Eya.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Untongi wakashandula akati, “Imi ndakabutenga bunizi yobu nemali inji kasa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulu wakati, “Koga imi ndakazwalwa ndili unizi,”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Nokudalo yabo bakaba, babulowumpenyengula bakabhuda pelyo naye, nontongi wakabotya, nokuti wakaziba kuti Paulu unizi weRoma akale nokuti wakaba onsunga namaketani.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu mbeli kwegota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Koga muchimuka, eda kuziba chisoko chokuti baJuda bakaba bompomela undandu weni, iye wakonsupula, akalaya batebuji bakulwana negota lyose kuti beshangane, akale iye akabuza Paulu mudako akale akomisa mbeli kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulu, wakatokoja makulukuta akati, “Banakwaina, imi ndagala mbeli kwaMwali mundangalilo imbuya kuswikila izhuba lyanasi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Untebuji unkulwana, Ananiyasi wakalaya yabo bakaba belimile pelyo naye kuti bondobe pandomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Pakalepo Paulu wakati kwaali, “Mwali unokuloba iwi bulambo bulocheneswa kuzhe! Unogalila kuti unditonge nomuMulawu koga uta zwinonyenyejana nomulawo, iwi unolaya kuti ndilobwe!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Yabo bakaba belimile pelyo naye bakati, “Iwi ungatuka untebuji unkulwana waMwali na!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulu wakati, “Andijabeziba, banakwaina, kuti iye untebuji unkulwana, nokuti zwilokwalwa muwhalo inchena kuti, ‘Autokwelela kulebeleka zwibi nontongi wabanhu babo,’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulu paakaziba kuti limwe igapo ngilyabaSadusi akale limwe lili lyabaFalisi, wakashomeja eti kugota, “Banakwaina imi NdinFalisi, mwananhulumyana wonFalisi, ndinopiwa undandu wokuba nechibimbo chokumuka kwabakafa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Paakaleba yezwi kwakaba nokusowhanana pakati pabaSadusi nabaFalisi, nokudalo ibungano lyakapatukana pakati. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Nokuti baSadusi banoti akuna kumuka kwabakafa, kana inhumwa yaMwali, kana mipepo, koga baFalisi banozwivuma zwose yezwi. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ngweno kwakaba nezhoba lyakaba ipo, bamwe bakwali begapo lyabaFalisi bakamilika bakondwila beti, “Isu atibweni chibi noyu unhulume. Zwingatikana kuti walebeleka nompepo kana kuti inhumwa yaMwali yalebeleka naye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Kunyenyejana pakwakandila mbeli, untungamili wabalwi wakatya, kuti Paulu bangonsapulilana wakalaya balwi kuti bebheluke benontola Paulu nesimba kuva mukati mwabo akale bombuze mubugalo bwabalwi.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Muchimuka busiku, Tezi wakama pelyo naye akati, “Sima, sezwawasumikija nezwangu muJelusalema, nokudalo unonopa busumikiji akale kuRoma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilangano nobupenyu bwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Pakwakeja, baJuda bakata chilangano akale bakata ikowhe yokusolya kana kunwa kuswikila bombulaya Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Bakababeli makumi mana yabo bakata yechi chilanganwa <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bakenda kubatebuji bakulwana nabakulugulu bakati, “Isu tazwisunga nekowhe kuti tose atitolabila zwolya kuswikila tombulaya Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Nokudalo, imwi negota, kumbilani kuntungamili wabalwi wobugalo kuti ombuze dako kunamwi, sabanhu bamuda kulingisisa undandu uwe zwesimiswa. Isu tilozwipila kumbulaya asanu aswika yopano.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ngweno mwananhulumyana wonkazwaji waPaulu wakawha chilongwa chokuumbwatilila, nokudalo iye wakenda akanongwina mubugalo bwabalwi akale akabuja Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Akale Paulu wakashoba umwe untungamili wezana lyabalwi akati, “Tola unhulumyana yoyo unsenge kuntongi wobugalo, nokuti iye yoyu unazwamuda kumbuja iye.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Sokudalo wakoontola akoonsenga kuntongi wobugalo akale akati, “Unsungwa Paulu wandishoba akandikumbila kuti ndibuze unhulumyana yoyu kwauli, nokuti unanozwamuda kukubuja iwi,”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Untongi wobugalo bwabalwi wakombhata luboko akenda naye kubhazu akale akombhuza musiswa, “Ini zwaumuda kundibuja imi!”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Iye wakati, “BaJuda balangana kukumbila kwauli kuti usenge Paulu dako kugota mangwana, sokuti bamuda kupyangisisa nozuzwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Koga usibawhilila, nokuti banhulume yabo banopinda makumi mana bokubhazu lyabo banombwatilila, balozwisunga nekowhe kusolya kana kunwa kuswikila bombulaya Paulu, akale ngweno balozwilonganyila, bakalindila imvumo inova kwauli.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Sokudalo, untongi wobugalo bwabalwi wakondeka enda, ondaya iye eti, “Usibuje umwe unhu kuti wandibuja yezwi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unosengwa Kuntongi Felekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Pakalepo wakashoba batungamili bezana lyabalwi, babili akati, “Pe awa yetatu yobusiku mubambanye balwi mazana mabili nabanhulume bamabhiza makumi mashanu ana mabili akale namazana mabili abalwi bamafhumo bachenda kuSizaliya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mulonganye zwichagadwa naPaulu akale muunswiche zwibuyanana kunaFelekisi untongi,” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Wakakwala lukwalo lwokulondejela:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kilaudiyasi Lisiyasi kuna Unolemekejwa, Untongi Felekisi: Ndokumusa. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Yoyu unhulume wakabhatwa nabaJuda, bakajoda kumbulaya, ndipo pandaswika imi nabalwi, ndikoonsungunula, ndawha kuti unizi wokuRoma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ndakada kuziba undandu ubakabompomela, ndakonsenga kugota lyabo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Imi ndakawana kuti umupomelwa undandu womulawo wabo, koga epiwa undandu usinokwelela lufu kana kungwina muntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Akale pandakabujwa kuti panachilangano naiye unhulume yoyu, imi ndontumija kwauli nokukambijisa, ndilaya bamumpomela undandu kuti bozwilebelekele mbeli kuko inyaya yeyi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Nokudalo balwi, sokubujwa kwabo, bakatola Paulu nobusiku bakonsenga kuAntipatilisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Muchimuka bakabwilila kubugalo bwabalwi, besiya bamabhiza kuti bende naye. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pabakaswika kuSizaliya bakaswincha lukwalo kuntongi nokutula Paulu kwaali. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Paakabala lukwalo, wakabhuza kuti unova kunalipi idunhu. Paakaziba kuti unova kuSilisiya <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />wakati, “Imi ndoowha kwauli, pabachaswika bamukupomela undandu.” Wakalaya kuti Paulu elindwe elimubugalo bwashe Helodi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Undandu waPaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Kwakati kwapinda mazhuba mashanu, untebuji unkukwana Ananiyasi, wakadelela nabamwe bakulwana nondebelekeli, unowhi Tetulasi. Bakatula undandu waPaulu mbeli kwontongi, <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />paakati ashobwa, Tetulasi wakatanga kuumpomela iye undandu eti, “Nokushinga kwenu isu timushantilwa nolunyalalo lukulwana, akale, mwakabuza inshanduko muluji yolu, <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />munzila jose, kwose kwose, kasa Felekisi, tozwitambula yezwi namaboko mabili. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Koga ndisinondila mbeli ndimucheleja, imi ndokukumbila mushe jenu kuti mutiwhe pashomanana. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Isu tawana yoyu unhulume eli umpalaji, unsungiliji pakati pabaJuda pasi pose, akale untungamili unkulwana wakakapo kamaNazalini. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Iye wakakweja kuswibhisa itempeli, koga takombhata. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Koga kwakoswika Lisiyasi untungamili wabalwi wakomvupula kwatili <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Mungompenyengula iye imwi nokwenu mungaba nechokomende chemilandu yatimumpomela.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />BaJuda naibo bakabhatana kumpomela undandu, besimisa kuti zwose yezwi ichokomende.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unozwilwila mbeli kwaFelekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Akale untongi paakonkobola kuti elebeleke, Paulu wakashandula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Sokuziba kwangu kuti kwamakole manji mwaba muli untongi wolu luji, imi ndozwilwila ndakashanta. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Nokuti mungawana kuti imi andina mazhuba anopinda igumi namabili ndenda kunonamata kuJelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />ibo abajakandiwana ndinyajana nonhu kana ndikovonga luvute, mutempeli kana musinagogi, kana muguta. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Ibo abatotubula kusimatija kwauli yezwi zwabamundipomela ngweno. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Koga imi ndinovuma mbeli kwenu kuti ndinonamata Mwali wamatategulu edu, neNzila yeyi, yabanoshoba kuti kakapo, ndidimbwa zwose zwilobigwa pasi mumulawo kana zwilokwalwa mubapolofeti, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />ndili nechibimbo munaMwali, zwili izwo zwabanovuma yaba, kuti kunooba nokumuka kwabakafa kwayabo balolulama akale nababi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Nezwo imi unshaji wose ndosoba noluyeyo lubuyanana kunaMwali nokubanhu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Kwakati kwapinda makole, ndakezha kobuza zwipo nompilo wemitebulo kuluji lwangu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Pandakaba ndita yezwi, ibo bakandiwana ndakacheneswa ndili mutempeli, ndisina luvute kana ibhesupesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Koga bamwe baJuda banova kuEzhiya, ndibo balokwelela kuba yopano mbeli kwenu, bendipa undandu, kana beli nechimwe chibakumundipomela. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Kana ibo banhu yaba, belebe kuti ini zwabakawana ndikachinya ndili mbeli kwegota, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />kuzhe kwewhi lyandakashomeja pakati kwabo, ‘Imi ndimutongeswa mbeli kwenu pezhulu pezwokumuka kwabakafa.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Asi Felekisi, eli noluzibo lulodondomeka nezweNzila, wakamisa undandu yoyo eti, “Paachadelela angoswika untungamili Lisiyasi ndipo pandichatonga inyaya yiyo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Pakalepo wakalaya untungamilili wezana lyabalwi, kuti Paulu unokwelela kuti egale mubusungwa, koga ebe nolusungunuko, akale bakwaina babe besijibiswe kuntila zwidikano zwizwe.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu mbeli kwaFelekisi naDulusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Kwakati kwapinda mazhuba, Felekisi wakezha nonkaji uwe Dulusila, wakaba elinhukaji wechiJuda, kova akatumila kuti Paulu ebuzwe kwaali kuti onwhe elebeleka nezwo kudimbwa kukwe munaKristo Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Paakaba enyenyeja nozwendulamo nokuzwibhata akale nezwokutonga kuchootika, Felekisi wakakatamuka akale akati, “Indaazwo kwangweno, pandichawana unshaji, imi ndookushoba.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Nonshaji wakaleyo iye wakayeya kuti pamwe Paulu angoompa imali. Nokudalo wakabonshoba tunjinji ekwejisa naye. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Koga pakwakapinda makole mabili, Posiasi Fesitasi wakatola chigalo chaFelekisi, nokuda kushantisa baJuda, Felekisi wakasiya Paulu elimuntolongo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulu unokumbila kutongwa naShe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ngweno Fesitasi aswika mudunhu lilye, mushule mwamazhuba matatu wakatanhisa enda kuJelusalema eva kuSizaliya. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Akale batebuji bakulwana namachinda abaJuda, bakapomela Paulu, bakasungulija Fesitasi, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />bonkumbila kuti ebatile ishe kuti ebatumijile unhulume yoyu kuJelusalema, bakalonganya kuumbwatilila kuti bombulaye munzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesitasi wakashandula eti, “Paulu ulolondotwa kuSizaliya mubusungwa, akale imi ndobwilila kwakwale nokukambijisa. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Nezwo itini batungamili benu bedelele nami, akale kana peli nezwinhu zwibi noyu unhulume, ngebenoompa undandu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Paakagala nabo mazhuba asinopinda mashanu anamatatu kana aligumi, wakadelelela kuSizaliya, muchimuka wakatola chigalo chiche chobutongi pegota, akalayila kuti Paulu ebuzwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paakati aswika Paulu, baJuda bakabadelela benda kuJelusalema bakama bakonzinguluka, bompomela milandu minji mikulwana, ibasakabetubula kusimatija. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulu wakati mukuzwilwila, “Apana undandu wandakata unotaluka mulawo wabaJuda, kana kuti iTempeli kana Kesali.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Koga Fesitasi eda kushantisa baJuda wakati kuna Paulu, “Iwi ungada na kunda kuJelusalema kuti ndinowhila undandu uwo kwakale!”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulu wakati, “Ndimile mbeli kwegota lyaKesali, ipo pandilokwelela kuti nditongwe, kubaJuda apana undandu undakata, sezwamunoziba kasa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Kana imi ndili nondandu, akale kuli nondandu undakata undilokwelela kutongelwa lufu, anditoshaka kutizha lufu, koga kana pesina chinhu pamilandu ibamundipomela, apana angandipila kwabali. Imi ndinokumbila kusengwa kunaSiza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Pakalepo Fesitasi, paakakwejisa negota lilye wakashandula eti, “Iwi wakumbila kusengwa kunaKesali, kunaKesali iwi unonda.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu mbeli kwaAgilipa naBhenisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ngweno kwapinda mazhuba, Agilipa, She naBhenisi bakaswika kuKesaliya kotambula Fesitasi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Sezwo bakagala mazhuba manji, Fesitasi wakatula undandu waPaulu kunashe, eti, “Pana unhulume wakasiyiwa eli unsungwa naFelekisi, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />pandakabeli kuJelusalema, batebuji bakulwana nabakulwanakulwana babaJuda bakandinyeulila nezuzwe, bekumbila kuti ndiuntonge. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Imi ndakabashandula ibo kuti, yezwi azwimo mungalilo yabaRoma kuti unhu umupomelwa undandu epilwe kuna aani naani, asashangana chiso nechiso nontamili uwe, akaba nonshaji wokuti iye ezwilwile pandandu waamupomelwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Nokudalo pabakezha ibo pamwempela, imi andijakapeja unshaji, koga muchimuka ndakatola chigalo changu chobutongi pegota ndikalayila kuti unhulume yoyo ebuzwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ibo batamili pabakamilika, abajakompomela undandu munyaya yiye sezwandakaba ndikalingilila, <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />koga bakanyenyejana, nezwokudimbwa kwabo zwisinowhisisika akale noumwe unowhi Jesu, wakafa, koga Paulu esimisa kuti umpenyu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Imi ndashayiwa kuti yezwi ndingazwipenyengula chini, ndakombhuza kuti iye angada na kunda kuJelusalema kuti enotongelwa yezwi kwakale. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Paulu paakakumbila kuti elondotwe muntolongo emilile untongo washe, imi ndakalaya kuti elondotwe kuswikila ndatubula kuuntumija kunaKesali.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa wakati kunaFesitasi, “Imi ndinodisisa kunwha unhulume yoyu nokwangu.” Iye akati, “Unonwha mangwana.” <verse eid="ACT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Muchimuka Agilipa naBhenisi bakezha namakatakata okuyebwa, ibo bakangwina mugota nabatungamili babalwi nabakulwanakulwana bomuguta. Pakalepo Fesitasi wakalayila kuti, Paulu ebuzwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesitasi wakati, “She Agilipa namwi mose mupo yopano, imwi mumbweni yoyu unhulume, ndiye watamijilwa nabanji bose babaJuda ndili kuJelusalema nokuno, beshomeja kuti aatokwelela kuba umpenyu. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Koga imi andijawana eli nechinhu chaakata chinokwelela lufu; akale sezwo iye emene wakakumbila kunoma mbeli kwashe; ndakasimikisa kuunsenga. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Koga andina chandinanacho chokuti ndingakwalila Tezi wangu nozuzwe yoyu. Nokudalo ndoombuza mbeli kwenu, kasa kasa mbeli kuko iwi She Agilipa, kuti patichapeja kuupenyengula iye, imi ndingawana chokukwala. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Nokuti kwandili zwinoboneka zwisina indangalilo imbuya, kutumija unsungwa pesina chitondejelo chemilandu yaamupomelwa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulu unozwilwila pambeli kwaAgilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agilipa wakati kunaPaulu, “Unemvumo yokuti uzwilebelekele iwi nokuko.” Pakalepo Paulu wakanyamula luboko akatanga kuzwilandula. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Imi nokwangu ndozwibona ndili nemazha, kuti ndime mbeli kuko She Agilipa, ndilimukuzwilwila nasi, ndakanangana nemilandu yose yandimupomelwa nabaJuda, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />nokuti iwi unaluzibo nongalilo akale nokunyenyejana kwabaJuda, nokudalo ndokukumbila kuti undiwhilile nomwoyo undefu.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Inzila yobupenyu bwangu kuvila ndichili umbisana, unshaji wose ndili munaboluji lwangu akale muJelusalema, yezwi zwinozibwa nabaJuda bose. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Ibo bagala banozwiziba kwonshaji undefu, kana beli nechido chokusumikija, kuti bupenyu bwangu bwabetobela kukudimbwa inzila inazwisungo zwilemu, ndabeli umFalisi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Ngweno yopa ndimile nditongeswa chibimbiso chakatiwa naMwali kumatategulu edu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />chili icho chilolingililwa nenduji jedu igumi nembili kuti jibuwane, sezwo zwibanonamata nesimba busiku namasikati. Pezhulu pezwi, imi ndimupomelwa undandu nabaJuda. Eya She! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ini zwinolangalisisa kuti azwitotubulika kuti Mwali emuse bakafa!<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Imi nokwangu ndakabwetekeja, kuti ndokwelela kuti ndite zwinhu zwinji zwinonyenyejana nezina lyaJesu wokuNazaleta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Yezwi ndakazwita muJelusalema, andijakakonyela chete bachena muntolongo, asi nesimba lyabatebuji bakulwana, pabakabebulayiwa imi ndakavumilana nazwo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Ndakabajiija tunji mumasinagogo wose akale ndikweja kuti betuke Mwali, akale nokubanyetelela zwikulwana ibo, imi ndakabayabisa nomumakuta enyika jabamwe.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Unolebeleka nozwokushanduka kukwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Mishingo 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Nokudalo ndakatola lwendo lwokunda kuDamasikasi, nesimba nokusungulwa nabatebuji bakulwana. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Nonshaji wamasikati makulwana, Eya she, imi ndili munzila ndakabona lupenyo luva kudenga, lwakapenya kupinda izhuba, lwakatutuma pandili nopanabo bakabekwenda nami. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Patakati tose tawila pasi, ndakawha iwhi liti kwandili mululimi lwechiHebhelu, ‘Saulu, Saulu ini undishetesa? Zwinokulwajisa iwi kubhakala lushoma.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Imi ndakati, ‘Ndiwi aani Tezi?’ Tezi wakati, ‘Ndimi Jesu, waumuyabisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Koga inyamuka ume namakumbo awo, nokuti ndazwitondejela kwauli nechinangwa yechi, kukuponcha kuti ushinge, ube unsumikiji kunezwawabona, akale nezwimwe zwichatobela ndizwitondejela kwauli, <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />ndikusungunula kubanhu nokuna Bokuzhe kwandinokutuma <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />kunozhula mesho abo, kuti ibo beshanduke bebhude munhilima benda kumwenje akale beve mumasimba aGuluzhanje bebuye kunaMwali, kutila kuti betambule kulekejelwa kwoluchinyo, akale nobugalo mukati mwaabo bakacheneswa nokudimbwa kwandili.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu unolebeleka nezwonshingo uwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“She Agilipa, andijakanyenyejana nechibono chokudenga, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />koga ndakazibisa kutanga bokuDamasikasi, kukoozha bokuJelusalema akale nomunyika yose yeJudiya, akale nokunaBokuzhe, kuti ibo beshanduke akale bebuye kunaMwali betukota mishingo inokwelela yabo bakashanduka. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Yechi ndicho chisoko, chabakandibhatila baJuda ndili mutempeli bekweja kundibulaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kuswikila yeli izhuba, imi ndimuwana lubhancho lunova kunaMwali, akale ndimile yopano kusumikija kunaibo bose batukutuku nabakulwana, ndileba chete zwakalebwa nabapolofeti naMozesi beti zwinootikana, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kuti Kristo unokwelela kujiijwa, akale kuti unooba wotanga kumuka kwabakafa, Iye unoopupula lumuniko kubaJuda akale nokunaBokuzhe.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Echinozwilwila, Fesitasi wakati newhi lyopezhulu, “Paulu, unopenga, indayijo yiyo yopezhulu imukupengesa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Koga Paulu wakati, “Anditopenga, unolemekejwa Fesitasi, koga ndimulebeleka ichokomende chipo pachena. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Iye she unozwiziba yezwi zwinhu, nokudalo imi ndolebeleka ndakasungunuka kwaali, nokuti nokubona kwangu apana zwinhu zwatikana esazwibona nokuti yezwi azwijakatikana mwakasisika. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />She Agilipa, munodimbwa bapolofeti na? Ndinozwiziba kuti unodimbwa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa wakati kuna Paulu, “Nonshaji unshoma umuyeya kundita unKristo!”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulu wakati, “Ungaba umfupi kana undefu, imi ndinoti Mwali ngate kuti kusibe iwi chete koga naibo bose bandiwha nasi yelino bebe sami, kuzhe kwamaketani yaya.” <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Pakalepo she wakanyamuka, pamwempela nagavena, Bhenisi, naibo bose baakabeligele nabo, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />pabakati babhuda yomo, bakati kunoumwe noumwe, “Yoyu unhulume apana chaamuta chinokwelela kuti ebulayiwe kana kuti ebigwe muntolongo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agilipa wakati kuna Fesitasi, “Yoyu unhulume walusungunulwa ngana asabakumbila kusengwa kunaKesali.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulu unonda kuRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Pakwakatiwa chisimiso chokuti tinde kuItali nobwato, bakasenga Paulu nabamwe basungwa kuntungamili wezana lyabalwi, “Wegapo lyamaAgasitani,” unowhi Juliyasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tangwina mubwato bokuAdilimitiumu, bwakaba bwalebokwenda bunda kuzwito, mumapambo eEzhiya, takakwenda mugungwa, tipelekejwa naAlisitakasi uMasedoniya unova kuTesalonika. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Muchimuka takangwina muSidoni, kwaakatilwa ishe Paulu naJuliyasi, kuumvumila kuti ende kubakwaina babe kuti bombanche. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Patakangwina mugungwa nobwato, takakwendela mulubavu lweSaipulasi, nokuti ibhepo lyakabeva kwatakabenda. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Tendila mbeli tikwenda takataluka igungwa liko kumbali kweSilisiya nePamfiliya, tikanoswika kuMila imomuLisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Yopo untungamili wezana lyabalwi wakawana bwato bwokuAlekizandiliya bunda kuItali, akatitanisa mwakale. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Takakwenda polepole kwamazhuba, tikaswika nobulemu kule neKinidasi akale nebhepo alijakativumila kuti tindile mbeli, tikakwenda takasikatilwa neKileti kule neSalimoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Takwenda nobulemu mubhambo lyeKileti, tikaswika kubugalo bunowhi Malo Mabuya, pelyo neguta lyeLasiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Sezwo takabalashikilwa nonshaji unji, igole lyeenda kwaswika unshaji unengozi kukwenda mugungwa. Akale izhuba lyolulekelelo lyakabapinda, Paulu wakabachenjeja eti, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Makulukuta, imi ndabona kuti lwendo yolu lunoba nokulwajiswa akale nokulashikilwa kukulwana, zwisi zwezwibiya nobwato chete, koga nobupenyu bwedu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Koga unkulwana wezana lyabalwi, wakawhilila unkulwana wobwato nomweni kunazwakalebwa naPaulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Nokuti pechito paluba pesakalulama kugalwa nonshaji wemhepo, banji babo bakayeya kuti kukwendwe, kuti umwe unshaji nemazha baluswika kuFonikisi, kuchito chokuKileti, chilolinga kuchaloba kulolelekela kubuvezhuba nechamhembe ilolelekela kubuvezhuba, begale yoko nonshaji wemhepo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibhepo Mugungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Palyakapunga zwinyolonyolo ibhepo lyechamhembe, bakabona kuti zwababeyeya zwingatikana, bakava banyamula ingobyo yobwato bakakwenda betobeleja ibhambo lyeKileti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Koga mushule mwonshaji unshomanana kwakaswika ibhepo igulwana linova kuchaloba lyakalelekela kubuvezhuba liva kunyika, <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />bwato pabwakangwina mubhepo abujakatubula kumilana nalyo, bwakasusumwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Akale patakasitwa nechibongo chitukutuku chinowhi Kauda, takatubula nobulemu kusunga kato, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />mushule mwokukanyamula, bakasunga zwokusimisa idako lyobwato, pakalepo betya kuti bungalobelelwa pebhambo lyeSailitisi, bakambweja ingobyo, bakasundwa nebhepo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Sezwo takabesundilwa yokunoku nebhepo, muchimuka, bakatangisa kulashila zwibiya mugungwa, <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />kooti nezhuba lyatatu bakalasha zwishingiso zwobwato namaboko abo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Pakwakatola mazhuba manji tisinobona izhuba kana inyenyeji, akale nebhepo igulwana kasakasa lindila mbeli lipunga, takava tabola myoyo kuti atitoomunulwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Bakaba nonshaji besina zwokulya, Paulu wakezha mbeli kunaibo akati, “Matate angu, ngana mwakangondiwhilila, tisakanyamuka kuva kuKileti amujalulwajiswa nokulashikilwa ali. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ngweno ndinoti ibani nemyoyo misimu, nokuti apana uchalashikilwa nobupenyu, koga bwato chete. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ndinodalo nokuti busiku bwanasi, ingilozi yaMwali, Iye wandili uwe akale wandinonamata, yandizhila, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ikati, ‘Usitye Paulu, iwi unokwelela kunoma mbeli kwaKesali, akale chokomende, Mwali wakupa bose baumukwenda nabo.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nokudalo matate angu, simani, imi ndodimbwa munaMwali kuti zwinooba sokubujwa kwangu. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Koga tolashilwa panechimwe chibongo.” <verse eid="ACT 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Pabwakaswika busiku bwegumi linabuna, tili mukukunguluka mugungwa lyeAdiliyatiki, pakati pobusiku bakwendesi bobwato bakayeyelela kuti bangaba pelyo nokumbali kwenyika. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bakakwela kumila kwevula bakawana kuti kunokwana makumi matatu anamashanu nemwempela amamita, bakwenda kashizho kafupi bakakwela akale, bakawana makumi mabili anamashanu namabili amamita. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Mukutya kuti tingangwina mumabwe, bakadeleja ingobyo ina mushule mobwato, bakanamata kuti kuje, <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />bakwendesi bobwato bakaba bepota inzila yokutizha mubwato, bakabadeleja kato mugungwa, benyepejela sabanhu bamudeleja ingobyo mbeli kobwato, <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Paulu wakati kuntungamili wezana lyabalwi, “Bangasogala mubwato yaba banhu, amungachijwe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Pakalepo balwi bakadumula minchili yakato, bakakalekeja kenda.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Kwaleboba kumijelo, Paulu wakabasungilija bose kuti belye eti, “Nasi izhuba lyegumi lina mana musilogajikana mumyoyo, akale musinolya, pesina chamwalabila. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nokudalo imi ndomukumbila kuti mulye, yezwi zwinomupa masimba, sezwo pesina uchalashikilwa kana nakanyala pakati penu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Wakati aleba yezwi, iye wakatola chinkwa, akaboka kunaMwali, pambeli pabo bose, akachimedula akatanga kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Pakalepo bose bakawha basungwajika ndokuva balyabo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Isu tose mubwato takaba tili mazana mabili, namakumi mashanu ana mabili, nashanu nomwempela. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Akale balya bakaguta, bakalelupisa bwato, bakalashila ikoloni mugungwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kundyondyomela kobwato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Pakwakeja, bakabona inyika koga abajakaiziba, bakangobona unsundila unejelenchele, bakalonga kuti bwato bunde pebhambo. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Bakasupula ingobyo bakajisiya mugungwa, nonshaji wakaleyo besupula minchili yakabakasunga inhando, pakalepo benyamula isaili lyambeli kubhepo benda kujelenchele. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Koga pabangwina pabugalo businomila mbeli kobwato kwakabhatilila busichinokwenda, akale ishule lyabwo lyakavunaulwa namapitu,<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Chilongwa chabalwi chakaba chili chokubulaya basungwa, kuti pesibe uchadwaya etizha, <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />koga untungamili wezana lyabalwi, eda kuchija Paulu, wakabajibisa kuta zwabakabeyeya. Wakabuja bakabetubula kudwaya kuti beshotokele muvula kutanga bende kunyika, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />asi bamwe bose bebhatilile pamapulanga kana pezwibabi zwobwato. Ndizwo zwakatisa kuti bose bevubuke beswike penyika.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">MuMoluta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Patakati tachila munezwi, ndipo patakaziba kuti tipo pechibongo chinowhi Moluta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bagali bwomo bakatitila ishe jisinolungululika, nokuti bakatibangijila moto, bakatitambula zwanana isu tose, nokuti kwakabatangisa kuna akale kutonhola. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulu wakabunganisa chikata chehuni jilokoma kova ejibiga mumoto, ndipo inyoka payakabhuda yawha kupisa ikanamatila paluboko lulwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Bagali bwomo pabakabona inyoka ikalengelela paluboko lulwe, bakati kunomwe noumwe, “Apana bukahajiko, yoyu unhulume umbulayi. Kojoba apunyuka mugungwa, bululami bwalamba kuti ebe umpenyu.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Iye, wakashashamulila inyoka mumoto, pesina zwatikana kwaali. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ibo bakamilila, belingilila kuti unozwimba kana kuti unowila pasi akafa, koga pabakati bamilila kwonshaji undefu besibweni chimutikana kwaali, bakashanduka mundangalilo bakati yoyu iye ndimwali.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Pelyo noobo bugalo pakaba peli nominda wonkulwana wechibongo unowhi Pabhuliyusi, wakatitambula kova etibalaija nenzila inoshantisa kwamazhuba matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Kwakatikana kuti dade baPabhuliyusi bakabakalajikwa nobulwaji bwokupisa kwombili akale nechishaba, Paulu wakava abashanyila akanamata ebabiga maboko awe akabachilisa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Pazwakati zwatikana yezwi, bose banhu bomuchibongo bakababeli namalwaji naibo bakezha bakachiliswa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Ibo bakatipa zwipo zwinji, akale patakakwenda bakatilongelela mubwato zwose zwatalushaka. <verse eid="ACT 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Kwapinda myeji mitatu ndokuva takwenda mubwato bwokuAlekizandiliya bwakapeja unshaji wose wemhepo buli pechibongo; mbeli kwabo paluba nechimwali chemisholo yaMambile. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Takaswika muSailakusi, takagala pakale kwamazhuba matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kuvila yopo takazinguluka tikajine tikaswika kuLejiumu; mushule mwezhuba limwempela, ibhepo lyokuchamhembe lyakapunga, ndilyo lyakatiswincha kuPuteoli mumazhuba mabili. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Yoko takawana banakwaina, ibo bakatikoka kuti tigale nabo kwamazhuba mashanu ana mabili. Tikanoswika kuRoma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Banakwaina boko, pabakawha nozwedu, bakezha kotitandamija beva kumusika weApiyasi akale nomungumba yaTatu yokuswikila. Paakababona, Paulu wakaboka Mwali akale akagajika moyo.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MuRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Patakaswika muLoma, Paulu wakavumijwa kugala ega, nondwi wakaba ondinda.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Mushule mwamazhuba matatu, wakashoba pamwempela batungamili babaJuda bomwakalemo, pabakati babungana iye wakati kwabali, “Banakwaina, kojoba ndisakabachinya chinhu kubanhu kana mungalilo yamatategulu edu, asi ndakapilwa ndili unsungwa kuJelusalema mumaboko abaLoma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Pabakati bandibhuzisisa, ibo bakada kundisunungula nokuti apajabeli chisoko chokunditongela lufu. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Koga pabakalamba baJuda, ndakakumbila kooma mbeli kwaKesali, kusi kuti pana zwandinotamijila boluji lwangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Nechi chisoko, ndizwo ndakumbila kuti ndimubone akale ndilebeleke namwi, nokuti zwakalingililwa naIzilayeli ndizwo zwakatisa kuti ndisungwe neketani yeyi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ibo bakati kwaali, “Isu atijakatambula lukwalo lunova kuJudiya lunoleba nezwizwo, akale apana umwe wabanakwaina wakezha yokuno akatilungululila zwibi nawi. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Koga toda kuwha kwauli indangalilo jijo, nokuti igapo yeli toziba kuti kosekose bakumulishunda.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Pabakati balangana izhuba, ibo bakezha nobunji kwaakabeligele. Iye wakababhaunulila inyaya kuvila zwingwanangwana kuswika madeko, epupula nezwobushe bwaMwali ekweja kubatondeja nezwaJesu zwibhuda mumilawu yaMozesi nezwinova kubapolofeti. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bamwe bakagunchikana nezwaakaleba koga bamwe abajakadimbwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Bakanyenyejana pakati pabo, bakanyamuka benda, mushule Paulu alebeleka iwhi lyokuti, “UMpepo uNchena wakaleba ilebeswa kumatategulu enu nondomo woMpolofeti Izaya.<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Nokuti wakati, ‘Inda kunoolu luji unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">moowha koga amutoowhisisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">akale kasa moolinga koga amutoobonesesa,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />nokuti moyo woluji yolu wakaba unkukutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nenzebe jabo ajidi kuwha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">mesho abo balowafwinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Nokuti bangabonesesa namesho abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nokuwha nenzebe jabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nokuwhisisa nemyoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">kuti bechingunuke kuti imi ndibachije.’”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Ngezwizibikane kwamuli ngweno kuti, “Yolu luchijo lwaMwali lwasengwa kunaBokuzhe, ibo banoonwhilila.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Alebeleka mawhi yaya Paulu, baJuda bakabhuda benyenyejana zwesimba pakati pabo.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Iye wakagala iko kwamakole mabili azhele, ezwilipila ingumba yiye, akale etambula bose bakabezha kwaali, <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />ebhaunula bushe bwaMwali nokulayija nozwaTezi Jesu Kristo zwili pachena akale pesina unondambija.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>